nt residence permit after arriving in Türkiye; lead time not specified."}}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO universities (slug, excel_rows_json, shard, fact_sheet_match_status, fact_sheet_files_json, cross_references_json, official_name, short_name, country, state_or_province, city, region, agreement_status, agreement_student_levels_json, min_standing_note, agreement_scope_raw, eligible_auc_schools_json, eligible_majors_json, excluded_majors_json, min_gpa_host, instruction_languages_json, english_course_availability, english_proficiency_and_rhet1020, host_language_requirement, available_terms_json, fall_term_dates, spring_term_dates, final_semester_allowed, seat_quota, tuition_model, est_monthly_living_currency, est_monthly_living_min, est_monthly_living_max, living_cost_usd_est, living_cost_usd_est_status, mandatory_host_fees_and_insurance, housing_availability, housing_notes, host_grants_or_stipends, citizenship_restrictions, visa_lead_time_and_financial_proof, official_website_url, exchange_page_url, course_catalog_url, english_course_list_url, credit_system_and_load, course_restrictions_note, required_application_docs_json, academic_style, city_tier, campus_type, daily_life_english_friendliness, international_support_services, nomination_deadlines, ext_json, metadata_json) VALUES ('auburn-university', '[8]', 5, 'matched', '["data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Auburn University Incoming Exchange Student Guide AY23-24 (1).pdf","data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Spring 2025 Exchange Quick Facts.pdf"]', '[]', 'Auburn University', 'AU', 'United States', 'Alabama', 'Auburn', 'North America', 'active', '["UG"]', NULL, 'HUSS', '["HUSS"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '["English"]', 'full', 'Proof of English proficiency is required in the incoming exchange application checklist; specific numeric minimum test scores and RHET 1020 equivalency are not stated in the AY23-24 incoming exchange guide.', 'English (primary language of instruction; proof of English required in application).', '["Fall","Spring"]', 'Fall 2026: Classes Aug 17 - Dec 4, 2026; Final Exams Dec 7 - Dec 11, 2026 (2-day orientation before classes; arrival 3-4 days prior).', 'Spring 2027: Classes Jan 6 - Apr 23, 2027; Final Exams Apr 26 - Apr 30, 2027 (Spring 2025 orientation Jan 9-10, arrival Jan 1-7).', NULL, NULL, 'auc_exchange_waiver', 'USD', 1500.0, 2200.0, 9250.0, 'partial', 'Tuition, Student Fees, and International Student Fee are waived during orientation check-in. Mandatory Auburn University Student Health Insurance Plan (SHIP, Blue Cross Blue Shield of Alabama; cannot be waived by exchange students) estimated at $1,000/semester in AY2024-25 guide ($2,317/year in 2027-2028 ISSS COA). Mandatory meal plan ($500-$1,500/semester) also applies.', 'assisted', 'On-campus housing is recommended (limited availability; opens ~Feb 15 for Fall / Sept for Spring via https://universityhousing.auburn.edu/; Quad, Village, South Donahue suites, and 160 Ross apartment-style recommended as open during holiday breaks; AY2024-25 rates $4,000-$6,500/semester incl. utilities/internet/laundry). Required meal plan ($500-$1,500/sem). Off-campus resources at https://offcampushousing.auburn.edu/housing.', NULL, NULL, 'J-1 Exchange Visitor Visa required (Form DS-2019 processed by ISSS ~1 week after undergraduate admission / ~2 weeks after graduate admission and mailed physically for U.S. Embassy/Consulate interview; exact visa wait times vary by country). Financial Statement in application checklist must show at least $5,000 USD per semester; passport valid 6+ months post-program.', 'https://www.auburn.edu/', 'https://www.auburn.edu/academic/international/auab/', 'https://bulletin.auburn.edu/coursesofinstruction/', NULL, 'US semester credit hours; J-1 full-time minimum is 12 credit hours/semester for undergraduates (typically 4-5 classes) and 9 credit hours/semester for graduate students (typically 3 classes).', 'Course availability depends on seats and AU faculty advisor approval (Business majors and students without an AU advisor coordinate with the Auburn Abroad Exchange Coordinator); specific courses cannot be guaranteed.', '["Auburn Abroad Portal questionnaire","Legible passport copy (valid >= 6 months post-program)","Proof of English proficiency","Financial Statement (>= $5,000 USD/semester in student''s or signed sponsor''s name)","Official Home University Transcript (in English)","Resume / CV (required for Engineering and certain majors)"]', 'Public land-grant research university (est. 1856, ~30,000 enrolled students, 150+ majors across 13 colleges); uses Canvas LMS and semester coursework with dedicated Finals Period.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Auburn Abroad advising, 2-day pre-term orientation, ISSS immigration & DS-2019 advising (intledu@auburn.edu), AU Medical Clinic & ClearWave support, Global Tigers Association (2 events/mo), 300+ clubs via AU Involve, Tiger Transit, Night Security Shuttle, and Atlanta Airport Groome Shuttle.', 'Fall Nomination: Feb 1 - Mar 15, Application: Feb 1 - Apr 1; Spring Nomination: Sep 1 - Oct 15, Application: Sep 1 - Nov 15 (rolling weekly review; commitment paperwork due 2 weeks pre-arrival).', '{}', '{"academic_style":{"notes":"Finals Period on data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Auburn University Incoming Exchange Student Guide AY23-24 (1).pdf#page=6; Canvas LMS on data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Auburn University Incoming Exchange Student Guide AY23-24 (1).pdf#page=10.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Auburn University Incoming Exchange Student Guide AY23-24 (1).pdf#page=4","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"partial","value":"Public land-grant research university (est. 1856, ~30,000 enrolled students, 150+ majors across 13 colleges); uses Canvas LMS and semester coursework with dedicated Finals Period."},"agreement_scope_raw":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:8","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"HUSS"},"agreement_status":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:8","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"active"},"agreement_student_levels":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:8","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":["UG"]},"available_terms":{"notes":"Fall/Spring","source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:8","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":["Fall","Spring"]},"campus_type":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"citizenship_restrictions":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"city":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:8","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"Auburn"},"city_tier":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"country":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:8","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"United States"},"course_catalog_url":{"notes":"Tentative per-term course lookup via Dynamic Schedule (https://ssbprod.auburn.edu/pls/PROD/bwckschd.p_disp_dyn_sched) cited in data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Auburn University Incoming Exchange Student Guide AY23-24 (1).pdf#page=14.","source_ref":"https://bulletin.auburn.edu/coursesofinstruction/","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":"https://bulletin.auburn.edu/coursesofinstruction/"},"course_restrictions_note":{"notes":"Priority consideration recommendation continued on data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Auburn University Incoming Exchange Student Guide AY23-24 (1).pdf#page=15.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Auburn University Incoming Exchange Student Guide AY23-24 (1).pdf#page=14","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"Course availability depends on seats and AU faculty advisor approval (Business majors and students without an AU advisor coordinate with the Auburn Abroad Exchange Coordinator); specific courses cannot be guaranteed."},"credit_system_and_load":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Auburn University Incoming Exchange Student Guide AY23-24 (1).pdf#page=15","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"US semester credit hours; J-1 full-time minimum is 12 credit hours/semester for undergraduates (typically 4-5 classes) and 9 credit hours/semester for graduate students (typically 3 classes)."},"cross_references":[],"daily_life_english_friendliness":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"eligible_auc_schools":{"notes":"Mapped from Excel Col G agreement scope ''HUSS''.","source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:8","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":["HUSS"]},"eligible_majors":{"notes":"Excel Col G lists school scope ''HUSS'' without restricting specific HUSS majors.","source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"english_course_availability":{"notes":"Guide p.14 states: ''The language of instruction is English (with the exception of foreign language courses.)''","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Auburn University Incoming Exchange Student Guide AY23-24 (1).pdf#page=14","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"full"},"english_course_list_url":{"notes":"All Auburn courses except foreign languages are taught in English (Guide p.14); filter term offerings in https://bulletin.auburn.edu/coursesofinstruction/ or Dynamic Schedule.","source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"english_proficiency_and_rhet1020":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Auburn University Incoming Exchange Student Guide AY23-24 (1).pdf#page=7","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"partial","value":"Proof of English proficiency is required in the incoming exchange application checklist; specific numeric minimum test scores and RHET 1020 equivalency are not stated in the AY23-24 incoming exchange guide."},"est_monthly_living_local":{"notes":"Derived from AY2024-25 semester estimate in Guide p.9 divided across a 5-month semester: Housing $4,000-$6,500 + Meal Plan $500-$1,500 + Additional Meals $1,000 + Spending Money $2,000 = $7,500-$11,000/semester ($1,500-$2,200/month). Excludes $1,000/sem mandatory insurance; Auburn ISSS 2027-2028 COA (https://www.auburn.edu/academic/international/isss/cost-of-attendance.html) lists $15,000/yr living expenses.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Auburn University Incoming Exchange Student Guide AY23-24 (1).pdf#page=9","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"partial","value":{"currency":"USD","max":2200.0,"min":1500.0}},"excel_rows":[8],"exchange_page_url":{"notes":"Also see https://auburn.edu/academic/international/site/incoming-exchange.html.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Spring 2025 Exchange Quick Facts.pdf#page=1","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"https://www.auburn.edu/academic/international/auab/"},"excluded_majors":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"ext":{},"fact_sheet_status":{"drive_links":["https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1ZoWb0Xwlp58EN2k7xBMsEhdPuMYJL7e5"],"extracted_files":["data/raw/extracted/Auburn/Auburn University Incoming Exchange Student Guide AY23-24 (1).pdf.txt","data/raw/extracted/Auburn/Spring 2025 Exchange Quick Facts.pdf.txt"],"local_files":["data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Auburn University Incoming Exchange Student Guide AY23-24 (1).pdf","data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Spring 2025 Exchange Quick Facts.pdf"],"match_status":"matched","notes":"Excel Col H blank, but matching public folder found in Drive master folder"},"fall_term_dates":{"notes":"Pre-class arrival/orientation timing from data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Auburn University Incoming Exchange Student Guide AY23-24 (1).pdf#page=6.","source_ref":"https://www.auburn.edu/academic/registrar/pdf/calendar/2026-2027-calendar.pdf","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":"Fall 2026: Classes Aug 17 - Dec 4, 2026; Final Exams Dec 7 - Dec 11, 2026 (2-day orientation before classes; arrival 3-4 days prior)."},"final_semester_allowed":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"host_grants_or_stipends":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"host_language_requirement":{"notes":"Application checklist item ''Proof of English'' listed in Guide p.7.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Auburn University Incoming Exchange Student Guide AY23-24 (1).pdf#page=14","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"partial","value":"English (primary language of instruction; proof of English required in application)."},"housing_availability":{"notes":"Guide p.12 notes limited on-campus availability via University Housing portal (recommended) alongside independent off-campus search options.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Auburn University Incoming Exchange Student Guide AY23-24 (1).pdf#page=12","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"assisted"},"housing_notes":{"notes":"Holiday-break recommendation (160 Ross) and arrival hotel guidance on data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Auburn University Incoming Exchange Student Guide AY23-24 (1).pdf#page=11; meal plan cost on data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Auburn University Incoming Exchange Student Guide AY23-24 (1).pdf#page=9.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Auburn University Incoming Exchange Student Guide AY23-24 (1).pdf#page=12","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"On-campus housing is recommended (limited availability; opens ~Feb 15 for Fall / Sept for Spring via https://universityhousing.auburn.edu/; Quad, Village, South Donahue suites, and 160 Ross apartment-style recommended as open during holiday breaks; AY2024-25 rates $4,000-$6,500/semester incl. utilities/internet/laundry). Required meal plan ($500-$1,500/sem). Off-campus resources at https://offcampushousing.auburn.edu/housing."},"instruction_languages":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Auburn University Incoming Exchange Student Guide AY23-24 (1).pdf#page=14","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":["English"]},"international_support_services":{"notes":"ISSS details on data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Auburn University Incoming Exchange Student Guide AY23-24 (1).pdf#page=10 & #page=23; shuttle on #page=11; clubs & GTA on #page=19.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Auburn University Incoming Exchange Student Guide AY23-24 (1).pdf#page=5","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"Auburn Abroad advising, 2-day pre-term orientation, ISSS immigration & DS-2019 advising (intledu@auburn.edu), AU Medical Clinic & ClearWave support, Global Tigers Association (2 events/mo), 300+ clubs via AU Involve, Tiger Transit, Night Security Shuttle, and Atlanta Airport Groome Shuttle."},"living_cost_usd_est":{"notes":"1 USD = 1.0 USD on 2026-11-15 (native USD); 5-month semester midpoint of $7,500-$11,000/semester living expenses (Housing $4,000-$6,500 + Meal Plan $500-$1,500 + Additional Meals $1,000 + Spending Money $2,000 = $9,250 midpoint) from Guide p.9. Excludes $1,000/sem mandatory health insurance and waived tuition/fees.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Auburn University Incoming Exchange Student Guide AY23-24 (1).pdf#page=9","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"partial","value":9250.0},"mandatory_host_fees_and_insurance":{"notes":"Non-waivable SHIP policy detailed at data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Auburn University Incoming Exchange Student Guide AY23-24 (1).pdf#page=13; 2027-2028 annual SHIP rate ($2,317) from https://www.auburn.edu/academic/international/isss/cost-of-attendance.html.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Auburn University Incoming Exchange Student Guide AY23-24 (1).pdf#page=9","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"Tuition, Student Fees, and International Student Fee are waived during orientation check-in. Mandatory Auburn University Student Health Insurance Plan (SHIP, Blue Cross Blue Shield of Alabama; cannot be waived by exchange students) estimated at $1,000/semester in AY2024-25 guide ($2,317/year in 2027-2028 ISSS COA). Mandatory meal plan ($500-$1,500/semester) also applies."},"min_gpa_host":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"min_standing_note":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"nomination_deadlines":{"notes":"Spring dates confirmed in data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Spring 2025 Exchange Quick Facts.pdf#page=1.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Auburn University Incoming Exchange Student Guide AY23-24 (1).pdf#page=6","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"Fall Nomination: Feb 1 - Mar 15, Application: Feb 1 - Apr 1; Spring Nomination: Sep 1 - Oct 15, Application: Sep 1 - Nov 15 (rolling weekly review; commitment paperwork due 2 weeks pre-arrival)."},"official_name":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:8","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"Auburn University"},"official_website_url":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:8","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"https://www.auburn.edu/"},"region":{"notes":"From normalized manifest country/region mapping","source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:8","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"North America"},"required_application_docs":{"notes":"Post-acceptance ClearWave immunization and negative TB skin test medical clearance also required (data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Auburn University Incoming Exchange Student Guide AY23-24 (1).pdf#page=5, #page=13).","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Auburn University Incoming Exchange Student Guide AY23-24 (1).pdf#page=7","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":["Auburn Abroad Portal questionnaire","Legible passport copy (valid >= 6 months post-program)","Proof of English proficiency","Financial Statement (>= $5,000 USD/semester in student''s or signed sponsor''s name)","Official Home University Transcript (in English)","Resume / CV (required for Engineering and certain majors)"]},"schema_version":"1.0.0","seat_quota":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"shard":5,"short_name":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Auburn University Incoming Exchange Student Guide AY23-24 (1).pdf#page=4","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"AU"},"slug":"auburn-university","spring_term_dates":{"notes":"Spring arrival/orientation timing pattern from data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Spring 2025 Exchange Quick Facts.pdf#page=1.","source_ref":"https://www.auburn.edu/academic/registrar/pdf/calendar/2026-2027-calendar.pdf","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":"Spring 2027: Classes Jan 6 - Apr 23, 2027; Final Exams Apr 26 - Apr 30, 2027 (Spring 2025 orientation Jan 9-10, arrival Jan 1-7)."},"state_or_province":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:8","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"Alabama"},"tuition_model":{"notes":"Guide p.9 Finance Information lists Tuition, Student Fees, and International Student Fee as ''Waived''.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Auburn University Incoming Exchange Student Guide AY23-24 (1).pdf#page=9","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"auc_exchange_waiver"},"visa_lead_time_and_financial_proof":{"notes":"Financial Statement threshold ($5,000/term) and 6-month passport validity from data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Auburn University Incoming Exchange Student Guide AY23-24 (1).pdf#page=7.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Auburn/Auburn University Incoming Exchange Student Guide AY23-24 (1).pdf#page=10","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"J-1 Exchange Visitor Visa required (Form DS-2019 processed by ISSS ~1 week after undergraduate admission / ~2 weeks after graduate admission and mailed physically for U.S. Embassy/Consulate interview; exact visa wait times vary by country). Financial Statement in application checklist must show at least $5,000 USD per semester; passport valid 6+ months post-program."}}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO universities (slug, excel_rows_json, shard, fact_sheet_match_status, fact_sheet_files_json, cross_references_json, official_name, short_name, country, state_or_province, city, region, agreement_status, agreement_student_levels_json, min_standing_note, agreement_scope_raw, eligible_auc_schools_json, eligible_majors_json, excluded_majors_json, min_gpa_host, instruction_languages_json, english_course_availability, english_proficiency_and_rhet1020, host_language_requirement, available_terms_json, fall_term_dates, spring_term_dates, final_semester_allowed, seat_quota, tuition_model, est_monthly_living_currency, est_monthly_living_min, est_monthly_living_max, living_cost_usd_est, living_cost_usd_est_status, mandatory_host_fees_and_insurance, housing_availability, housing_notes, host_grants_or_stipends, citizenship_restrictions, visa_lead_time_and_financial_proof, official_website_url, exchange_page_url, course_catalog_url, english_course_list_url, credit_system_and_load, course_restrictions_note, required_application_docs_json, academic_style, city_tier, campus_type, daily_life_english_friendliness, international_support_services, nomination_deadlines, ext_json, metadata_json) VALUES ('augsburg-university', '[9]', 6, 'matched', '["data/raw/factsheets/Augsburg/2025-2026/Augsburg University.pdf","data/raw/factsheets/Augsburg/2025-2026/WORLDWIDE_ISSS Exchange Flyer.pdf"]', '[]', 'Augsburg University', NULL, 'United States', 'Minnesota', 'Minneapolis', 'North America', 'active', '["UG"]', 'Must be a full-time degree-seeking student at an exchange partner, have completed at least 1 year of college/university study, and be in good academic standing at the home institution.', 'University-wide', '["ALL"]', '["ALL"]', NULL, NULL, '["English"]', 'full', 'Non-native speakers: TOEFL iBT 80 (pBT 550 / Essentials 8.5), IELTS 6.5, Duolingo 105, SAT EBRW 570, or ACT English+Reading 22; ISSS Exchange Flyer notes other measures of proficiency may also be accepted. No RHET 1020 waiver stated.', NULL, '["Fall","Spring"]', 'Fall 2026 final exams Dec 14–17, 2026 (full term start/end dates on Augsburg Registrar Academic Calendar).', 'Spring 2027 final exams May 3–6, 2027 (full term start/end dates on Augsburg Registrar Academic Calendar).', NULL, NULL, 'auc_exchange_waiver', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'unknown', 'Estimated student fees/books/materials $900/semester and health insurance $800/semester (AY 2024-2025 Fact Sheet); SEVIS I-901 fee required for J-1 visa.', 'assisted', 'On-campus housing application for Anderson Hall dorm (double room $3,494/sem AY 2024-25) and required 15+ meal plan ($2,817/sem); Global Living Community LLC details at https://www.augsburg.edu/residencelife/living-learning-communities-llcs/.', NULL, NULL, 'J-1 Exchange Visitor Visa using Augsburg-issued DS-2019 form; pay SEVIS I-901 fee and allow at least 1 month for travel/arrival planning.', 'https://www.augsburg.edu/', 'https://studyabroad.augsburg.edu/index.cfm?FuseAction=Programs.ViewProgramAngular&id=55177', 'http://www.augsburg.edu/catalog/', 'http://www.augsburg.edu/catalog/', 'US Semester Credits; full-time exchange course load 12–19 credits per semester (most courses are 4 credits).', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'urban', NULL, 'International Student and Scholar Services (ISSS, Science Hall 112, isss@augsburg.edu): DS-2019/J-1 advising, mandatory international orientation, scheduled airport pickups, Global Living Community.', 'Fall: Nomination Mar 1 (Fact Sheet/Flyer) or Mar 15 (official web), Application Mar 15 or Mar 21 (official web); Spring: Nomination Oct 1, Application Oct 15.', '{}', '{"academic_style":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"agreement_scope_raw":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:9","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"University-wide"},"agreement_status":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extract