 registration quotas, and instructor consent noted on p.3; Turkish-taught Law/TLL courses on p.4.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Bogazici/2026-2027/Fact sheet 2026-2027.pdf#page=9","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"Exchange students must take at least 1 course from their registered host department (Erasmus >=2); application course lists are provisional and finalized during registration subject to quotas and instructor consent. Some Law and Turkish Language & Literature courses are taught in Turkish."},"credit_system_and_load":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Bogazici/2026-2027/Fact sheet 2026-2027.pdf#page=4","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"Boğaziçi credit-hour system (typical course is 3-4 credits / 5-7 ECTS); incoming exchange students take 4-6 courses totaling 17-21 Boğaziçi credits (~20-30 ECTS) per semester. Grading scale: AA (4.0) to DD (1.0) pass, F (0.0) fail."},"cross_references":[],"daily_life_english_friendliness":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"eligible_auc_schools":{"notes":"Normalized from agreement_scope_raw == ''University-wide''.","source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:12","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":["ALL"]},"eligible_majors":{"notes":"Normalized from agreement_scope_raw == ''University-wide''.","source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:12","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":["ALL"]},"english_course_availability":{"notes":"AY 2026-2027 Fact Sheet p.4 states Boğaziçi University is a 100% English-medium institution (some Law and Turkish Language & Literature courses offered in Turkish).","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Bogazici/2026-2027/Fact sheet 2026-2027.pdf#page=4","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"full"},"english_course_list_url":{"notes":"Boğaziçi is a 100% English-medium institution (ex