6-2027 Fall: Mandatory Orientation Week Aug 31 – Sep 5, 2026; Fall Term Sep – Dec 2026."},"final_semester_allowed":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"host_grants_or_stipends":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"host_language_requirement":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Central European University (CEU)/2026-2027/CEU Fact Sheet_2026-27.pdf#page=1","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"None required (English is the working language; optional free German courses offered)."},"housing_availability":{"notes":"2026-2027 fact sheet page 2 states ''CEU does not operate dormitories''; housing FAQ: https://www.ceu.edu/student-life/arriving/accommodation/faq.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Central European University (CEU)/2026-2027/CEU Fact Sheet_2026-27.pdf#page=2","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"off_campus_only"},"housing_notes":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Central European University (CEU)/2026-2027/CEU Fact Sheet_2026-27.pdf#page=2","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"CEU does not operate dormitories; incoming students arrange private/student housing in Vienna via guidance at https://www.ceu.edu/student-life/arriving/accommodation/faq."},"instruction_languages":{"notes":"English is the working and instructional language at CEU.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Central European University (CEU)/2026-2027/CEU Fact Sheet_2026-27.pdf#page=1","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":["English"]},"international_support_services":{"notes":"Orientation Week also on page 1.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Central European University (CEU)/2026-2027/CEU Fact Sheet_2026-27.pdf#page=2","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"Mandatory Orientation Week, Student Life Office visa/residence assistance, Academic Support, Counseling, Career Services, Disability Rights Officer, and free German classes."},"living_cost_usd_est":{"notes":"5-month exchange semester estimate: 1000 EUR/month * 5 months * 1.1052 = 5526.00 USD using ECB 2026-11-13 rate (1 EUR = 1.1052 USD, https://www.ecb.europa.eu/stats/policy_and_exchange_rates/euro_reference_exchange_rates/html/index.en.html, collected 2026-11-15).","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Central European University (CEU)/2025-2026/CEU Fact Sheet 2025_2026_Final.pdf#page=2","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"partial","value":5526.0},"mandatory_host_fees_and_insurance":{"notes":"ÖH fee from CEU Tuition & Fees page; health insurance rules from 2026-2027 fact sheet page 2.","source_ref":"https://www.ceu.edu/tuition-fees","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":"Austrian Student Union (ÖH) fee 26.20 EUR/semester (52.40 EUR/year); mandatory health insurance required (EHIC for EU/EEA or MA35-compliant Austrian insurance for non-EU/EEA)."},"min_gpa_host":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"min_standing_note":{"notes":"2025-2026 fact sheet page 1 explicitly states BA students can only apply for Winter + Spring combined; asterisk retained in 2026-2027 fact sheet page 1.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Central European University (CEU)/2025-2026/CEU Fact Sheet 2025_2026_Final.pdf#page=1","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"Home nomination and competitive application review required; BA exchange students can only be nominated for Winter + Spring terms combined, not Spring-only."},"nomination_deadlines":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Central European University (CEU)/2026-2027/CEU Fact Sheet_2026-27.pdf#page=1","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"AY 2026-2027 Fall: Nomination Apr 15 / Application Apr 30; Winter & Spring: Nomination Oct 15 / Application Oct 30."},"official_name":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:17","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"Central European University"},"official_website_url":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:17","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"https://www.ceu.edu/"},"region":{"notes":"From normalized manifest country/region mapping","source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:17","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"Europe"},"required_application_docs":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"https://www.ceu.edu/admissions/non-degree","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":["Online non-degree application form","Official university transcripts","Proof of English proficiency (or CEFR letter)","Approved course selection"]},"schema_version":"1.0.0","seat_quota":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"shard":4,"short_name":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Central European University (CEU)/2026-2027/CEU Fact Sheet_2026-27.pdf#page=1","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"CEU"},"slug":"central-european-university","spring_term_dates":{"notes":"2025-2026 fact sheet page 1 confirms BA students cannot apply for Spring term alone.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Central European University (CEU)/2026-2027/CEU Fact Sheet_2026-27.pdf#page=1","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"AY 2026-2027 Winter Term Jan – Mar 2027; Spring Term Apr – Jun 2027 (BA exchange students must take Winter + Spring combined)."},"state_or_province":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"tuition_model":{"notes":"Reciprocal exchange students continue paying home tuition and are exempt from CEU tuition.","source_ref":"https://www.ceu.edu/academics/bachelors/exchange","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":"auc_exchange_waiver"},"visa_lead_time_and_financial_proof":{"notes":"URL linked from 2026-2027 fact sheet page 2 visa section.","source_ref":"https://www.ceu.edu/student-life/arriving/residence-documents","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":"Non-EU/EEA stays over 90 days require Visa D (up to 6 months) or Student Residence Permit; Austrian financial proof thresholds: 533.85 EUR/month (under 24) or 966.65 EUR/month (24+), plus rent exceeding 299.95 EUR/month."}}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO universities (slug, excel_rows_json, shard, fact_sheet_match_status, fact_sheet_files_json, cross_references_json, official_name, short_name, country, state_or_province, city, region, agreement_status, agreement_student_levels_json, min_standing_note, agreement_scope_raw, eligible_auc_schools_json, eligible_majors_json, excluded_majors_json, min_gpa_host, instruction_languages_json, english_course_availability, english_proficiency_and_rhet1020, host_language_requirement, available_terms_json, fall_term_dates, spring_term_dates, final_semester_allowed, seat_quota, tuition_model, est_monthly_living_currency, est_monthly_living_min, est_monthly_living_max, living_cost_usd_est, living_cost_usd_est_status, mandatory_host_fees_and_insurance, housing_availability, housing_notes, host_grants_or_stipends, citizenship_restrictions, visa_lead_time_and_financial_proof, official_website_url, exchange_page_url, course_catalog_url, english_course_list_url, credit_system_and_load, course_restrictions_note, required_application_docs_json, academic_style, city_tier, campus_type, daily_life_english_friendliness, international_support_services, nomination_deadlines, ext_json, metadata_json) VALUES ('cetys-universidad', '[18]', 5, 'matched', '["data/raw/factsheets/CETYS/2025/CETYS Fact Sheet 2025.pdf"]', '[]', 'CETYS Universidad', 'CETYS', 'Mexico', NULL, 'Baja', 'Latin America & Caribbean', 'active', '["UG","GR"]', NULL, 'University-wide', '["ALL"]', '["ALL"]', NULL, NULL, '["Spanish","English"]', 'limited', 'Minimum CEFR B2 (upper intermediate) proficiency required for courses in English; proof of English or Spanish proficiency is required in the application (RHET 1020 waiver not mentioned).', 'Minimum CEFR B2 (upper intermediate) in Spanish for Spanish-taught courses, or CEFR B2 in English for English Global Programs.', '["Fall","Spring"]', 'AY2025 reference pattern: Arrival/pickup Jul 28-31; Orientation Aug 1; Semester (incl. exams) Aug 4 - Dec 10 (see https://www.cetys.mx/en/school-calendar/ by campus for 2026-27).', 'AY2025 reference pattern: Arrival/pickup Jan 13-16; Orientation Jan 17; Semester (incl. exams) Jan 20 - Jun 3 (see https://www.cetys.mx/en/school-calendar/ by campus for 2026-27).', NULL, NULL, 'auc_exchange_waiver', 'USD', 600.0, 600.0, 3000.0, 'partial', 'Tuition fees waived under partner agreement. Health insurance (including COVID-19 coverage) is mandatory for all students; students must show proof prior to arrival or purchase insurance at CETYS upon arrival.', 'off_campus_only', 'No on-campus dormitories; International Office supplies a list of off-campus housing options. Shared student housing estimated at USD $250-$300/month plus utilities.', NULL, NULL, 'CETYS assists incoming exchange students in obtaining student visas when required; non-restricted nationalities staying <=180 days may enter under Mexico''s FMM/visitor rules while restricted nationalities or >180-day stays require a consular Mexican student visa prior to arrival.', 'https://www.cetys.mx/en/international-programs/', 'https://www.cetys.mx/en/international-students/', NULL, 'https://www.cetys.mx/en/academic-programs/undergraduate-programs/international-business/', 'Up to 5 courses per semester; 1 CETYS course = 8 credits (64 contact hours over 16 weeks, 4 hours/week).', 'Course availability depends on selected campus (Mexicali, Tijuana, or Ensenada); English Global Programs are only on Mexicali/Tijuana, while Spanish courses for non-credit are offered at Ensenada.', '["Online CETYS e-application","Official academic transcript","Letter of recommendation from home faculty member","Proof of Spanish or English language proficiency (CEFR B2)","Letter of intent","Copy of valid passport"]', NULL, NULL, 'multi_campus', NULL, 'Free airport pickup from Mexicali, Tijuana, or San Diego (US) airports; orientation day; non-credit Spanish language courses and Buddy Program at Ensenada International Campus.', 'AY2025 pattern: Spring nomination Sep 1 - Nov 1 / application Nov 15; Fall nomination Mar 1 - May 15 / application May 30.', '{}', '{"academic_style":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"agreement_scope_raw":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:18","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"University-wide"},"agreement_status":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:18","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"active"},"agreement_student_levels":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:18","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":["UG","GR"]},"available_terms":{"notes":"Fall/Spring","source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:18","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":["Fall","Spring"]},"campus_type":{"notes":"Three campuses across Baja California: Mexicali, Tijuana, and Ensenada International Campus.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/CETYS/2025/CETYS Fact Sheet 2025.pdf#page=1","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"multi_campus"},"citizenship_restrictions":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"city":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:18","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"Baja"},"city_tier":{"notes":"Agreement covers three Baja California campuses (Mexicali, Tijuana, Ensenada); no single city_tier applies across Excel city ''Baja''.","source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"country":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:18","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"Mexico"},"course_catalog_url":{"notes":"Academic program lists are campus-specific; request syllabi from Ensenada (internacionales.ens@cetys.mx), Tijuana (internacionales.tij@cetys.mx), or Mexicali (internacionales.mxli@cetys.mx).","source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"course_restrictions_note":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/CETYS/2025/CETYS Fact Sheet 2025.pdf#page=2","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"Course availability depends on selected campus (Mexicali, Tijuana, or Ensenada); English Global Programs are only on Mexicali/Tijuana, while Spanish courses for non-credit are offered at Ensenada."},"credit_system_and_load":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/CETYS/2025/CETYS Fact Sheet 2025.pdf#page=3","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"Up to 5 courses per semester; 1 CETYS course = 8 credits (64 contact hours over 16 weeks, 4 hours/week)."},"cross_references":[],"daily_life_english_friendliness":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"eligible_auc_schools":{"notes":"Excel agreement scope states ''University-wide''.","source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:18","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":["ALL"]},"eligible_majors":{"notes":"Excel agreement scope states ''University-wide''.","source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:18","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":["ALL"]},"english_course_availability":{"notes":"100% English ''Global Programs'' offered in International Business and Industrial Engineering (Mexicali & Tijuana) plus selected English courses at Ensenada.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/CETYS/2025/CETYS Fact Sheet 2025.pdf#page=2","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"limited"},"english_course_list_url":{"notes":"100% English Global Programs at Mexicali/Tijuana also include Industrial Engineering (https://www.cetys.mx/en/academic-programs/undergraduate-programs/industrial-engineering/); Ensenad