 Degree applicants require GMAT 650 and TOEFL iBT 100 or IELTS 7.0.', 'None required for English-taught Master and MBA exchange terms.', '["Fall","Spring"]', 'Fall 2026: International MBA Sep 28-Dec 18, 2026; Specialized Masters Oct 7-Dec 18, 2026.', 'Winter 2027: Jan 11-Mar 19, 2027; Winter-Spring 2027: Jan 11-Jun 30/Jul 31, 2027.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'EUR', 1110, 2070, 8786, 'partial', 'Spanish public health system excludes international students; private health insurance strongly recommended plus FIATC accident insurance coverage.', 'off_campus_only', 'No on-campus housing; estimated off-campus rent EUR 450-900/month plus utilities EUR 100-200/month.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'http://www.eada.edu/', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ECTS credit system; Fall Masters ~16-17 ECTS, Winter Masters 25-29 ECTS; all courses in the chosen term/programme are mandatory.', 'Students cannot mix courses across different Master/MBA programmes; all term courses are mandatory; max 2 seats per Master programme and max 1 seat per MBA programme.', '["Application form","Passport or EU ID copy","CV","Master/MBA transcripts","Home-institution English sufficiency letter"]', 'Case study, role-play, and experiential outdoor leadership training modules at the Collbató residential campus.', NULL, 'multi_campus', NULL, 'Exchange coordinator desk (exchange@eada.edu), external housing assistance links (Studentfy), and FIATC accident insurance guidance.', 'AY 2026-2027 deadlines: Fall May 4, 2026; Winter Sep 14, 2026 (nomination/application).', '{}', '{"academic_style":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/EADA Business School/2026-2027/EADA FACT SHEET 2026-2027.pdf#page=7","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"Case study, role-play, and experiential outdoor leadership training modules at the Collbató residential campus."},"agreement_scope_raw":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:27","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value"