t tracks: TOEFL 80, IELTS 6.5, TOEIC 750, Cambridge C, Duolingo 110, OR a home-university certificate confirming completion of or current study in an English-taught degree programme (RHET 1020 policy not explicitly named; AUC instruction is in English).', 'French CEFR B2 attestation from home university required only for French-taught or bilingual tracks; English-only tracks do not require French.', '["Fall","Spring"]', '2026-27 web update & 2025-26 calendar: Fall semester runs late August/early September to mid/late December; mandatory online info session Jul 20, 2026; mandatory orientation Sep 4, 2026 (Nancy/Paris) and Sep 14-16, 2026 (Berlin).', '2026-27 web update & 2025-26 calendar: Spring semester runs early January to mid/late May; mandatory online info session Dec 16, 2026; mandatory orientation Jan 8-9, 2027 (Nancy/Paris) and early Jan 2027 (Berlin).', NULL, NULL, 'auc_exchange_waiver', 'EUR', 400.0, 1000.0, 3868.2, 'partial', 'Tuition fees waived under exchange agreement; approx. EUR 40 library fee applies (p.9). Health insurance is mandatory: EU students use EHIC; non-EU students in France enroll in free French Social Security upon registration (etudiant-etranger.ameli.fr) while Germany campus students require Sozialversicherungsausweis / valid German student insurance.', 'assisted', 'State-owned university residences ~150-535 EUR/mo; furnished studios in private residences ~400-500 EUR/mo. Support via LivinFrance platform and seasonal housing intern (Apr-Sep: housing-info@icn-artem.com).', NULL, NULL, 'For France, ICN adheres to the CEF (Etudes en France / Campus France) visa convention; LivinFrance platform provides step-by-step French/German visa support.', 'https://www.icn-artem.com/en/', 'https://www.icn-artem.com/en/exchange-programmes/', 'https://www.icn-artem.com/en/exchange-programmes/', 'https://www.icn-artem.com/en/exchange-programmes/', NULL, 'Courses cannot be mixed across different programmes or academic levels due to timetable constraints; MSc 2 / Master 2 accepts Fall semester exchange students only; bilingual tracks require both French and English B2 proficiency; max age 25.', '["Partner university online nomination","Completed online application form","ID photo","Copy of passport or identity card","Academic transcripts from last 2 years","CV (in French or English depending on track)","Letter of motivation (in French or English depending on track)","English test/degree-in-English certificate (for English tracks) or French B2 attestation (for French tracks)"]', 'Triple-accredited (AACSB, EQUIS, AMBA) French business school built on interdisciplinary ARTEM pillars connecting Management, Technology, and Art.', NULL, 'multi_campus', NULL, 'ICN International Relations Office (icnexchange@icn-artem.com), mandatory online info sessions, campus orientation days (plus optional French Alps seminar for English Bachelor track), LivinFrance onboarding platform, and seasonal housing intern.', '2026-27 deadlines: Fall semester / Full year May 15; Spring semester October 15.', '{}', '{"academic_style":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/ICN Business School/2025-2026/ICN Business School Fact Sheet - Exchange Students - 2025-2026.pdf#page=2","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"Triple-accredited (AACSB, EQUIS, AMBA) French business school built on interdisciplinary ARTEM pillars connecting Management, Technology, and Art."},"agreement_scope_raw":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:41","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"Business Administration"},"agreement_status":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:41","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"active"},"agreement_student_levels":{"notes":"Blank in partner Excel agreement list; ICN 2025-26 fact sheet covers Bachelor in Management (Y2-Y3) and Master/MSc programmes.","source_ref":null,"source_type":"unk