-Nov 21, 2026; mid-terms Oct 5-10, 2026; end-terms Nov 23-28, 2026.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'unknown', 'Mandatory worldwide health insurance covering at least INR 200,000 (~USD 3,500) valid in India for the duration of stay.', 'assisted', 'On-campus hostel (subject to availability): INR 20,000/term + veg mess INR 25,000/month (+ INR 4,000 non-veg). Off-campus alternatives: serviced apartments ~INR 20,000/month (excl. food) or nearby hotels INR 1,600-3,500/day (per 2020-2021 fact sheet; current page https://www.iimb.ac.in/about-institute/life-iimb/accommodation).', NULL, 'Exchange program at IIMB is not open to students holding an Indian passport.', 'Student Visa only required (no tourist visa); IIMB provides admission letter for visa application but does not issue financial guarantees. Lead time not specified.', 'http://www.iimb.ac.in/', 'https://www.iimb.ac.in/student-exchange-programme', NULL, NULL, 'Most courses carry 3 credits (some 1.5 credits); 1 credit = 10 classroom contact hours. Required credit workload is determined by the student''s home institution.', 'Restricted to Term V graduate PGP/MBA elective courses (open to 2nd-year MBA/PGP or 5th-year integrated students who completed foundation coursework; mandatory 80% attendance per course per iimb.ac.in).', '["Online Sarvam ERP upload","Brief resume","2 passport-size photos","Latest academic transcript","Infectious-disease-free health certificate","Passport and visa copy","Signed hostel code of conduct","Signed release-cum-indemnity bond","English proficiency certificate/letter"]', 'Rigorous postgraduate management curriculum with mandatory minimum 80% attendance per course and mid-term plus end-term examinations.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ATHITHI weekend host-family program with IIMB alumni families; Office of International Affairs (OIA) pre-arrival accommodation and ERP onboarding support.', 'Term V nomination deadline Apr 1 (2026-2027 cycle).', '{}', '{"academic_style":{"notes":null,