4.5 post-Jan 21, 2026; IELTS >= 6.5).', '["Fall","Spring"]', 'Fall 2026: Classes Aug 26 - Dec 11, 2026; Final Exams Dec 12 - Dec 18, 2026 (Fall Break Oct 7-11; Thanksgiving Nov 23-27; orientation held the week prior per Fact Sheet p.2).', 'Spring 2027: Classes Jan 19 - May 5, 2027; Final Exams May 6 - May 12, 2027 (Spring Break Mar 15-19).', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'USD', 1939.0, 1939.0, 9694.0, 'partial', 'Mandatory CISI health insurance: $1,656/year (split between fall and spring semesters; waivable only upon arrival with proven equivalent abroad coverage meeting U.S. Dept. of State rules). On-campus internet fee $138/semester (2026-27); 2021-22 sheet also noted $100/semester International Student Fee and $40 Housing Contract Fee.', 'assisted', 'On-campus housing contract and preferences processed after acceptance via Residential Life (rms.jmu.edu). AY 2026-27 per-semester housing rates: $3,428-$4,228 (+$500 single occupancy) + $138 internet + mandatory resident meal plan ($3,438-$3,819/sem).', NULL, NULL, 'J-1 Exchange Visitor Visa (Form DS-2019 sent with acceptance packet). Financial evidence is a required initial application document ($53,250/yr international student COA total incl. $33,862 tuition/insurance, $15,088 living, $4,300 books/personal, $276 internet; exchange students document non-tuition living and fee support).', 'http://www.jmu.edu/', 'https://www.jmu.edu/global/abroad/exchange-students-inbound.shtml', 'https://www.jmu.edu/catalog/', NULL, 'US semester credit hours; J-1 visa compliance requires minimum 12 credits per semester in-person (approx. 4 courses).', 'Nursing, Medicine, Hospitality/Tourism Management, and College of Business (economics, finance, accounting, administration, management, marketing, etc.) are closed to exchange students. Preferred course list submitted at application, but specific enrollment is not guaranteed.', '["Home institution nomination","Personal statement","Official transcript","Financial evidence","Passport copy","English language proficiency scores (TOEFL/IELTS)","Preferred course selections","Enrollment, housing, and JMU Honor Code signature documents"]', 'Public university in Virginia (~22,000 UG/GR students, ~4,000 faculty/staff) on a semester calendar with dedicated final exam week.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'JMU Center for Global Engagement advising, pre-semester orientation (1 week in Fall / 1 day in Spring), airport pickup from Washington Dulles International Airport (IAD), free English Language Learning Center tutoring, LIFE local-family connection program, Culture Nights, International Week, and career workshops.', 'Fall / Academic Year: Nomination March 1, Application April 1; Spring: Nomination October 1, Application November 1.', '{}', '{"academic_style":{"notes":"2026-27 semester exam schedules at https://www.jmu.edu/registrar/adjustable-calendar.shtml.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/James Madison University/James Madison University Incoming Exchange Info Sheet 2021-2022 - Global Dukes.pdf#page=1","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"partial","value":"Public university in Virginia (~22,000 UG/GR students, ~4,000 faculty/staff) on a semester calendar with dedicated final exam week."},"agreement_scope_raw":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:51","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"University-wide"},"agreement_status":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:51","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"active"},"agreement_student_levels":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:51","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":["UG"]},"available_terms":{"notes":"Fall/Spring","source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:51","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":["Fall","Spring"]},"campus_type":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unkn