glish","Polish"]', 'substantial', 'Minimum B2 English required (FCE, IELTS, TOEFL, or official home-institution confirmation if current programme is taught in English; confirm RHET 1020 / English-medium confirmation).', 'None required for English-taught courses; optional Polish for beginners available.', '["Spring","Academic Year"]', 'AY 2025-2026 Fall (host term dates): late Sep 2025-late Jan/mid-Feb 2026 (exams). Note: AUC Excel specifies Spring and Academic Year.', 'AY 2025-2026 Spring: mid-Feb 2026-mid-Jun 2026 (exams late Jun).', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'EUR', 783, 1113, 5239, 'partial', 'Non-EU students require valid medical/travel insurance covering minimum EUR 30,000.', 'assisted', 'No university-owned dormitories; shared rooms ~1,400-2,200 PLN/mo, private dorms ~1,800-3,500 PLN/mo, utilities 500-1,200 PLN/mo per KU living guide (2+ room apartments 4,500-7,000 PLN/mo); AY 2025-2026 fact sheet p.4 notes EUR 500-700/mo rent.', NULL, NULL, 'Non-EU students staying >90 days require a Polish National Visa (even if holding another EU country''s residence permit) plus EUR 30,000 medical insurance; exact consulate lead time and solvency amount not itemized.', 'http://www.kozminski.edu.pl/', 'https://www.kozminski.edu.pl/incoming/', 'https://kozminski.my.site.com/s/sylabus-exchange-incoming-students', NULL, 'ECTS credit system; normal full-time load 30 ECTS/semester (maximum 35 ECTS).', 'Undergraduate and graduate students may mix Bachelor and Master courses with home-institution approval; Law students may take Business courses as well.', '["ID or passport copy","Medical insurance proof (min EUR 30,000 for non-EU)","JPG photo","Academic transcript","B2 English certificate or home-institution confirmation"]', 'Polish 2.0-5.0 grading scale.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'KU Mate buddy programme, airport pickup, optional Polish language course for beginners, and KU International Society support.', 'Fall / Academic Year: nomination May 1, application Jun 1; Spring: nomination Dec 1, app