d; mandatory EHIC (EU) or private international health insurance covering healthcare and medical repatriation in Belgium for non-EU students. Optional Sports Affiliation €60."},"min_gpa_host":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"min_standing_note":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"https://uclouvain.be/en/colleges-institutes/lsm/incoming-exchange-students.html","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":"Graduate-level Master''s exchange (4th-5th university year) in Management and Business Engineering at Louvain School of Management."},"nomination_deadlines":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"https://uclouvain.be/en/colleges-institutes/lsm/incoming-exchange-students.html","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":"LSM incoming exchange nomination/registration deadlines: May 15 (Fall Term / Full Academic Year); Nov 15 (Spring Term)."},"official_name":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:64,65","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"Louvain School of Management (UC Louvain)"},"official_website_url":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:64,65","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"https://uclouvain.be/en/faculties/lsm"},"region":{"notes":"From normalized manifest country/region mapping","source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:64,65","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"Europe"},"required_application_docs":{"notes":"Mobility-Online workflow verified in Partners_MOL_Guide.pdf; documents verified via uclouvain.be.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/UC Louvain/Partners_MOL_Guide.pdf#page=1","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":["Home university nomination in Mobility-Online","Online Mobility-Online application & Learning Agreement","Language proficiency proof (B2 English recommended)","Passport / ID copy","Health insurance proof (EHIC or non-EU repatriation policy)"]},"schema_version":"1.0.0","seat_quota":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"shard":7,"short_name":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:64,65","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"UC Louvain"},"slug":"louvain-school-of-management-uc-louvain","spring_term_dates":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"https://uclouvain.be/en/colleges-institutes/lsm/incoming-exchange-students.html","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":"LSM Spring Term: Late January / early February to late June (2026-2027 UCLouvain exchange schedule shows welcome week Jan 25-28, Orientation Jan 29, classes Feb 1-May 15, exams May 31-Jun 26/27, resits Aug 13-Sep 3, 2027)."},"state_or_province":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"tuition_model":{"notes":"Officially nominated incoming exchange students under Erasmus+ or bilateral agreements are exempt from paying tuition fees at UCLouvain.","source_ref":"https://uclouvain.be/en/international/come-to-uclouvain.html","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":"auc_exchange_waiver"},"visa_lead_time_and_financial_proof":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"https://uclouvain.be/en/international/come-to-uclouvain.html","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":"Non-EU/EEA nationals require a Belgian Long-stay Type D Student Visa using UCLouvain''s enrollment authorization; 2026-2027 statutory Belgian financial solvency minimum is €1,062 net/month (€12,744/12 months + admin fees via blocked account, scholarship, or Annex 32 guarantor)."}}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO universities (slug, excel_rows_json, shard, fact_sheet_match_status, fact_sheet_files_json, cross_references_json, official_name, short_name, country, state_or_province, city, region, agreement_status, agreement_student_levels_json, min_standing_note, agreement_scope_raw, eligible_auc_schools_json, eligible_majors_json, excluded_majors_json, min_gpa_host, instruction_languages_json, english_course_availability, english_proficiency_and_rhet1020, host_language_requirement, available_terms_json, fall_term_dates, spring_term_dates, final_semester_allowed, seat_quota, tuition_model, est_monthly_living_currency, est_monthly_living_min, est_monthly_living_max, living_cost_usd_est, living_cost_usd_est_status, mandatory_host_fees_and_insurance, housing_availability, housing_notes, host_grants_or_stipends, citizenship_restrictions, visa_lead_time_and_financial_proof, official_website_url, exchange_page_url, course_catalog_url, english_course_list_url, credit_system_and_load, course_restrictions_note, required_application_docs_json, academic_style, city_tier, campus_type, daily_life_english_friendliness, international_support_services, nomination_deadlines, ext_json, metadata_json) VALUES ('lund-university', '[66]', 8, 'matched', '["data/raw/factsheets/Lund University/2025-2026/LU-fact-sheet-2025-2026.pdf","data/raw/factsheets/Lund University/2025-2026/Lund University Exchange Student Timeline - Autumn_5.png","data/raw/factsheets/Lund University/Lund University/LU Fact Sheet 2025-2026 - accessible.pdf","data/raw/factsheets/Lund University/postcard-Lusem.pdf"]', '[]', 'Lund University', 'LU', 'Sweden', NULL, 'Lund', 'Europe', 'active', '["UG","GR"]', NULL, 'University-wide', '["ALL"]', '["ALL"]', '["Bioinformatics","Journalism","Industrial Design"]', NULL, '["English","Swedish"]', 'substantial', 'Recommended English proficiency equivalent to IELTS 6.5 / TOEFL iBT 90 (certified via partner university nomination; see https://www.lunduniversity.lu.se/english-requirements). RHET 1020 waiver not stated.', 'Not required for English-taught courses; Swedish B2/C1 proficiency required only for courses taught in Swedish.', '["Fall","Spring"]', '2026-08-31 to 2027-01-17 (AY 2026-2027 Autumn semester)', '2027-01-18 to 2027-06-06 (AY 2026-2027 Spring semester; preliminary Arrival Day Jan 11, 2027)', NULL, NULL, 'auc_exchange_waiver', 'SEK', 9000, 12000, 5223.8, 'partial', 'No application or tuition fee. Incoming exchange students are automatically covered by the Swedish State''s Insurance for Foreign Students (Kammarkollegiet).', 'assisted', 'Not guaranteed via LU Accommodation (https://www.luaccommodation.lu.se/); alternatives include AF Bostäder and BoPoolen. Typical rent SEK 4,000–8,000/month (`money-and-living-costs`).', NULL, NULL, 'Non-EU/EEA exchange students staying >3 months require a Swedish residence permit for higher education studies via Migrationsverket; 2026 minimum maintenance proof is SEK 10,656/month covering the full study period.', 'http://www.lunduniversity.lu.se/', 'https://www.lunduniversity.lu.se/exchange-studies', 'https://www.lunduniversity.lu.se/admission-requirements-exchange-courses', NULL, 'ECTS (1 Lund University credit = 1 ECTS); full-time exchange workload is 30 ECTS/semester (typically four 7.5 ECTS courses) and 60 ECTS/year.', 'Closed programs: Bioinformatics, Journalism, Industrial Design. University-wide exchange students may enroll in at most 15 ECTS/semester at LUSEM (School of Economics and Management). Limited course changes permitted after semester start.', '["Official Transcript of Records (Bachelor and Master if applicable)","List of ongoing courses (mandatory if not listed on transcript)","Eligibility form (required for Faculty of Engineering / LUSEM)","Portfolio (for Architecture, Design, Music, and Fine Arts)"]', NULL, 'college_town', 'multi_campus', NULL, 'Arrival Day, Orientation Weeks, LU Accommodation support, Student Health Services, and verifiable LADOK digital transcripts.', 