Semester: Sep 2 - Dec 22, 2026 (select Bachelor programmes e.g. Entrepreneurship/Tourism & Leisure; Social/Health/Public Mgmt) OR Oct 1, 2026 - Feb 20, 2027 (all other programmes); incl. orientation & initial exams.', 'AY 2026-2027 Spring Semester: Mar 2 - Jun 30, 2027 across all programmes (Excel also notes Mar-Jun).', NULL, NULL, 'auc_exchange_waiver', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'unknown', 'Mandatory Austrian Student Union (ÖH) membership + MCI administrative fee totaling approx. EUR 50 per semester (includes basic accident/liability insurance).', NULL, 'Consult MCI incoming accommodation guide immediately upon nomination: https://international.mci.edu/en/students/international-exchange-students/accommodation.', NULL, NULL, 'Non-EU/EEA students require Austrian Visa D or Residence Permit (Aufenthaltsbewilligung Student) depending on stay duration; apply early via Austrian Embassy using MCI acceptance docs.', 'https://www.mci.edu/de/', 'https://www.mci.edu/en/international/study-internationally/exchange-students', 'https://www.mci.edu/en/international/study-internationally/courses-in-english/syllabi', 'https://www.mci.edu/en/international/study-internationally/courses-in-english/syllabi', 'ECTS credit system; up to 30 ECTS maximum per semester (no MCI minimum enforced, home university minimum applies).', 'AUC Excel list flags ''only 3 courses in english for UG'' in Business; MCI policy directs choosing modules from a single primary degree programme plus optional International Program courses (first-come, first-served).', '["Home university nomination","Online MCI exchange application","Academic transcript","English B2/C1 proficiency proof (standard test or MCI online English test)"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'MCI International Relations Office pre-arrival, visa, housing, and online English test guidance.', 'Fall/Winter semester: Nomination Apr 1, Application May 1 (some guidelines extend to May 15); Spring/Summer semester: Nomination Oct 1, Application Nov 1 (up to No