ll Semester: Early September – January (classes normally start mid-September; arrival early September).', 'Spring Semester: Late March – July (classes normally start early April; arrival late March).', NULL, NULL, 'auc_exchange_waiver', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'unknown', 'Mandatory Japanese National Health Insurance (~¥14,400/year in Tokyo), Comprehensive Student Insurance (¥9,060 for 1 semester / ¥12,500 for 2 semesters), and ¥25,000 refundable dorm deposit.', 'guaranteed', 'Mandatory placement in University-owned off-campus dormitories: MG Okusawa House (Tokyo, single room, ¥50,000/mo, no meal plan) or MISH (Yokohama, single room, ¥80,000/mo w/ weekday & Sat breakfast/dinner); ¥25,000 deposit; paid in semester lump sum.', NULL, NULL, 'Certificate of Eligibility (COE) requires minimum financial proof of ¥400,000 (1 semester) or ¥800,000 (2 semesters); JPETS TB screening note applies where required.', 'https://www.meijigakuin.ac.jp/en/', 'https://www.meijigakuin.ac.jp/en/international/students/', 'https://www.meijigakuin.ac.jp/en/international/students/academics_program/', NULL, 'MGU credit system; maximum 24 credits per semester (Japanese language 1–4 credits; English content seminars typically 2 credits each).', 'No graduate-level courses open to ISP exchange students; Shirokane (Tokyo) and Yokohama campuses are ~90 minutes apart by commute.', '["ISP Checklist","ISP Application Form","ISP Certificate of Health","ISP Japanese Language Form","COE Application Form & financial proof","Official transcript","Language test scores"]', NULL, NULL, 'multi_campus', NULL, 'Arrival orientation, mandatory Resident Registration and Japanese National Health Insurance enrollment assistance, and dedicated ISP dormitories.', 'ACY 2026-2027 Partner Nomination: Spring (Apr entry) Sep 1 – Oct 1 (App Oct 10–24); Fall (Sep entry) Feb 1 – Mar 1 (App Mar 10–24).', '{}', '{"academic_style":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"agreement_sc