ge students pay tuition directly to their home institution rather than NC State.","source_ref":"https://studyabroad.ncsu.edu/incoming-exchange-student/financial-matters/","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":"auc_exchange_waiver"},"visa_lead_time_and_financial_proof":{"notes":"Confirmed with AY 2024-2025 Fact Sheet p. 5; exact DS-2019 minimum USD threshold not published on public page.","source_ref":"https://studyabroad.ncsu.edu/incoming-exchange-student/visa-and-immigration-process/","source_type":"official_web","status":"partial","value":"J-1 visa ONLY (NC State does not issue F-1 visas for exchange students); submit DS-2019 request in Global Home with passport and official proof of funding covering living expenses, insurance, and fees. Mandatory OIS immigration check-in at orientation."}}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO universities (slug, excel_rows_json, shard, fact_sheet_match_status, fact_sheet_files_json, cross_references_json, official_name, short_name, country, state_or_province, city, region, agreement_status, agreement_student_levels_json, min_standing_note, agreement_scope_raw, eligible_auc_schools_json, eligible_majors_json, excluded_majors_json, min_gpa_host, instruction_languages_json, english_course_availability, english_proficiency_and_rhet1020, host_language_requirement, available_terms_json, fall_term_dates, spring_term_dates, final_semester_allowed, seat_quota, tuition_model, est_monthly_living_currency, est_monthly_living_min, est_monthly_living_max, living_cost_usd_est, living_cost_usd_est_status, mandatory_host_fees_and_insurance, housing_availability, housing_notes, host_grants_or_stipends, citizenship_restrictions, visa_lead_time_and_financial_proof, official_website_url, exchange_page_url, course_catalog_url, english_course_list_url, credit_system_and_load, course_restrictions_note, required_application_docs_json, academic_style, city_tier, campus_type, daily_life_english_friendliness, international_support_services, nomination_deadlines, ext_json, metadata_json) VALUES ('northern-arizona-university', '[78]', 8, 'matched', '["data/raw/factsheets/Northern Arizona University/Fact Sheet 2024-25.pdf","data/raw/factsheets/Northern Arizona University/NAU Info for Sp. 25.docx","data/raw/factsheets/Northern Arizona University/NAU exchange program flyer.pdf","data/raw/factsheets/Northern Arizona University/Northern Arizona University.pdf"]', '[]', 'Northern Arizona University', 'NAU', 'United States', 'Arizona', 'Flagstaff', 'North America', 'active', '["UG","GR"]', 'Minimum 2.5/4.0 cumulative GPA and official home-university nomination required.', 'University-wide', '["ALL"]', '["ALL"]', '["Dental Hygiene","Nursing"]', 2.5, '["English"]', 'full', 'Minimum TOEFL iBT 70 (code 4006; MyBestScore accepted; 3.5 on updated TOEFL scale), IELTS 6.0, Duolingo 95, European CEFR B2 (for European exchange), or native/English-medium school documentation. RHET 1020 waiver not stated.', 'English proficiency required (see english_proficiency_and_rhet1020).', '["Fall","Spring"]', '2026-08-24 to 2026-12-11 (AY 2026-2027 Fall term)', '2027-01-11 to 2027-05-07 (AY 2026-2027 Spring term)', NULL, NULL, 'auc_exchange_waiver', 'USD', 1753, 1753, 8765.0, 'partial', 'NAU Student Health Insurance Plan (SHIP) is strictly mandatory for all international exchange students per Arizona Board of Regents policy and cannot be waived ($1,838 Spring 2027 / ~$2,956 full year on campus health site; 2024-25 factsheet listed $1,088 Fall / $1,788 Spring). Mandatory immunizations (MMR) required prior to class registration.', 'assisted', 'Residence halls & NAU International House (~$4,380/sem housing + $2,885/sem meals in 2024-25 Fact Sheet; 2025-26/2026-27 housing portal at http://nau.edu/residence-life). Single-semester exchange students typically pay ~60% of academic-year housing rate.', NULL, NULL, 'J-1 visa (Form DS-2019) required; ISSS requires English-language bank statements or financial guarantee covering total estimated fees and living expenses for the stay in Flagstaff.', 'https://nau.edu/?utm_source=google%20maps&utm_medium=organic', 'https://nau.edu/isss/exchange-students/', NULL, NULL, 'US credit hours: minimum 12 credits to maximum 19 credits per semester.', 'All majors open to exchange students EXCEPT Dental Hygiene and Nursing.', NULL, NULL, 'college_town', NULL, NULL, 'ISSS J-1 DS-2019 support, NAU International House living-learning community, and Campus Health Services.', 'Fall Semester: nomination April 1, application April 15. Spring Semester: nomination October 1, application October 15 (late applications considered case-by-case).', '{}', '{"academic_style":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"agreement_scope_raw":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:78","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"University-wide"},"agreement_status":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:78","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"active"},"agreement_student_levels":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:78","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":["UG","GR"]},"available_terms":{"notes":"Fall/Spring","source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:78","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":["Fall","Spring"]},"campus_type":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"citizenship_restrictions":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"city":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:78","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"Flagstaff"},"city_tier":{"notes":"Flagstaff, Arizona described by NAU as a mountain college town at 7,000 ft elevation.","source_ref":"https://nau.edu/isss/exchange-students/","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":"college_town"},"country":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:78","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"United States"},"course_catalog_url":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"course_restrictions_note":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Northern Arizona University/Fact Sheet 2024-25.pdf#page=1","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"All majors open to exchange students EXCEPT Dental Hygiene and Nursing."},"credit_system_and_load":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Northern Arizona University/Fact Sheet 2024-25.pdf#page=1","source_type":"fact_sheet","status"