ll","Spring"]', 'AY 2025-2026 Fall: Recommended arrival Sep 15, 2025 (semester dates per academic calendar).', 'AY 2025-2026 Spring: Recommended arrival Feb 2, 2026 (semester dates per academic calendar).', NULL, NULL, 'auc_exchange_waiver', 'EUR', 600, 700, 3592, 'partial', 'Mandatory valid health insurance required (EHIC is NOT valid in Türkiye); one-time EUR 20 residence permit card fee; tuition and registration fees waived.', 'guaranteed', 'On-campus Çekmeköy dormitories available upon signing binding housing agreement (deposit waived for exchange students); estimated rent EUR 450-650/month.', NULL, NULL, 'Turkish student visa processing takes 6-8 weeks before departure; mandatory Turkish Residence Permit application required upon arrival (EUR 20 fee); financial proof threshold not specified.', 'https://www.ozyegin.edu.tr/', 'https://www.ozyegin.edu.tr/en/international-cooperation-exchange-programs/exchange-programs/global-exchange/incoming-students', 'https://www.ozyegin.edu.tr/en/ects-course-catalog-courses-offered/courses-offered?utm_source=footer', NULL, 'ECTS credit system; regular load 30 ECTS/semester (maximum 36 ECTS).', 'AUC agreement covers Undergraduate (UG) level only per Excel.', NULL, 'US letter grading scale (minimum passing grade D for UG, C for GR); English-medium campus in Çekmeköy, Istanbul.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'IEPP international exchange office, optional 4-ECTS Turkish for Foreigners course, residence permit guidance, and on-campus sports facilities.', 'AY 2025-2026: Fall application Jul 16 (nominations ~1 month prior); Spring application Dec 1 (nominations ~1 month prior).', '{}', '{"academic_style":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Ozyegin University/2025-2026/ozyegin_university_fact_sheet_2025-26.pdf#page=3","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"US letter grading scale (minimum passing grade D for UG, C for GR); English-medium campus in Çekmeköy, Istanbul."},"agreement_scope_raw":{"notes":null,"source_ref":