se only)"]', NULL, '["Chinese","English"]', 'limited', 'Fact sheet p.3 states English test proof is not required during the application process, though select English-taught courses/departments may require proficiency verification or test scores (RHET 1020 policy not mentioned).', 'Chinese HSK Level 6 (over 70 points per item) required for Chinese-taught UG/GR courses; NO Chinese proficiency required for Chinese language training courses.', '["Fall","Spring"]', 'AY 2020-2021 reference calendar (Fact Sheet p.2; check http://www.pku.edu.cn/campuslife/xl/index.htm for 2026-27 dates): Autumn semester Sep 14 - Jan 17.', 'AY 2020-2021 reference calendar (Fact Sheet p.2; check http://www.pku.edu.cn/campuslife/xl/index.htm for 2026-27 dates): Spring semester Feb 22 - Jun 27.', NULL, NULL, 'auc_exchange_waiver', 'CNY', 1000.0, 3000.0, 1498.82, 'partial', 'Application, tuition, and administrative fees normally waived under bilateral agreements. Exchange students MUST purchase the designated Chinese medical insurance plan at CNY 400 per semester.', 'assisted', 'Global Village (Zhong Guan Xin Yuan) on-campus dorms ~3,300-4,500 RMB/month (shared facilities, automatic if agreement covers free dorms; else online booking mid-Jul/mid-Jan via studyatpku.com); off-campus ~2,000-5,000 RMB/month (Ziroom/BeijingBuddy).', NULL, 'Applicants must be non-Chinese citizens holding a valid foreign passport, aged between 18 and 45.', NULL, 'http://english.pku.edu.cn/', 'http://www.oir.pku.edu.cn/en/', 'http://dean.pku.edu.cn/pkudean/course/kcb.php?ll=1', 'http://dean.pku.edu.cn/englishcourses/index.html', 'Chinese academic credit system (16-week semester; 1 credit = 1 class hour/week): Chinese-language track requires min 18 class hrs/week (2-5 courses); regular UG/GR coursework load is 6-20 credits (2-10 courses) per semester.', 'Excluded: Health Science Center, School of Software & Microelectronics, Shenzhen Graduate School (case-by-case), special English Master''s (MBA, MIR, MPP, LLM, Yenching), double-degree/tailor-made programmes. Chinese-taught Master''s courses require faculty permit; departments retain right to restrict course enrollment.', '["Home university email nomination + official paper nomination letter","Completed PKU online application (studyatpku.com)","Original English-version hard copies mailed via home international office","Language proof if required (HSK 6 for Chinese-taught degree courses)"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Office of International Relations (OIR, exchange@pku.edu.cn) and International Students Division (ISD Room 330 New Sun Student Center, study@pku.edu.cn) handle nominations, Global Village dorm placement, orientation Chinese placement interviews, and visa documents.', 'Autumn / Full Year: Nomination deadline March 30; Online application Feb 20 - Apr 15. Spring Semester: Nomination deadline October 30; Online application Sep 20 - Nov 15.', '{}', '{"academic_style":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"agreement_scope_raw":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:85","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"GAPP"},"agreement_status":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:85","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"active"},"agreement_student_levels":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:85","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":["UG","GR"]},"available_terms":{"notes":"Fall/Spring","source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:85","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":["Fall","Spring"]},"campus_type":{"notes":"Historic Yanyuan main campus at No. 5 Yiheyuan Road, Haidian District, Beijing (no strict urban/suburban label in verified schema terms).","source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"citizenship_restrictions":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Peking University/Fact Sheet PKU 2020-2021 (updated).pdf#page=3","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"Applicants must be non-Chinese citizens holding a valid foreign passport, aged between 18 and 45."},"city":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:85","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"Beijing"},"city_tier":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"country":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:85","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"China"},"course_catalog_url":{"notes":"Also course preview at http://dean.pku.edu.cn/jiaoxuejihua/kcbxs.php?ll=1 (p.3); next-semester lists posted mid-Jan / mid-Jul.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Peking University/Fact Sheet PKU 2020-2021 (updated).pdf#page=2","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"http://dean.pku.edu.cn/pkudean/course/kcb.php?ll=1"},"course_restrictions_note":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Peking University/Fact Sheet PKU 2020-2021 (updated).pdf#page=4","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"Excluded: Health Science Center, School of Software & Microelectronics, Shenzhen Graduate School (case-by-case), special English Master''s (MBA, MIR, MPP, LLM, Yenching), double-degree/tailor-made programmes. Chinese-taught Master''s courses require faculty permit; departments retain right to restrict course enrollment."},"credit_system_and_load":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Peking University/Fact Sheet PKU 2020-2021 (updated).pdf#page=3","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"Chinese academic credit system (16-week semester; 1 credit = 1 class hour/week): Chinese-language track requires min 18 class hrs/week (2-5 courses); regular UG/GR coursework load is 6-20 credits (2-10 courses) per semester."},"cross_references":[],"daily_life_english_friendliness":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"eligible_auc_schools":{"notes":"Excel agreement scope states ''GAPP''.","source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:85","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":["GAPP"]},"eligible_majors":{"notes":"Excel agreement scope specifies AUC School ''GAPP'' rather than ''University-wide''.","source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"english_course_availability":{"notes":"Fact sheet p.3 notes instruction is mainly Chinese with some English-taught courses available (reference list at http://dean.pku.edu.cn/englishcourses/index.html).","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Peking University/Fact Sheet PKU 2020-2021 (updated).pdf#page=3","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"limited"},"english_course_list_url":{"notes":"Also noted on p.3.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Peking University/Fact Sheet PKU 2020-2021 (updated).pdf#page=2","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"http://dean.pku.edu.cn/englishcourses/index.html"},"english_proficiency_and_rhet1020":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Peking University/Fact Sheet PKU 2020-2021 (updated).pdf#page=3","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"partial","value":"Fact sheet p.3 states English test proof is not required during the application process, though select English-taught courses/departments may require proficiency verification or test scores (RHET 1020 policy not mentioned)."},"est_monthly_living_local":{"notes":"PKU Fact Sheet p.5 lists general monthly living expenses of 1,000-3,000 RMB/month EXCLUDING accommodation (Global Village dorm 3,300-4,500 RMB/mo or off-campus 2,000-5,000 RMB/mo; bilateral agreements may cover free housing per p.4). Live ISD guide (https://www.isd.pku.edu.cn/en/index.php?m=content&c=index&a=lists&catid=31) lists annual estimates of RMB 15,000 food, RMB 5,000 misc, and RMB 35,000 accommodation.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Peking University/Fact Sheet PKU 2020-2021 (updated).pdf#page=5","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"partial","value":{"currency":"CNY","max":3000.0,"min":1000.0}},"excel_rows":[85],"exchange_page_url":{"notes":"ISD website: https://isd.pku.edu.cn; online portal: http://www.studyatpku.com.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Peking University/Fact Sheet PKU 2020-2021 (updated).pdf#page=2","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"http://www.oir.pku.edu.cn/en/"},"excluded_majors":{"notes":"Chinese-taught Master''s courses require departmental permission; faculties with special prerequisites excluded.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Peking University/Fact Sheet PKU 2020-2021 (updated).pdf#page=4","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":["Health Science Center","School of Software and Microelectronics","Tailor-made and Double-degree programs","MBA / Master in International Relations / Master in Public Policy / LLM in Chinese Law / Yenching Academy special English graduate programs","Shenzhen Graduate School (case-by-case only)"]},"ext":{},"fact_sheet_status":{"drive_links":["https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1PXVKfwtF1DBACWY6pVSktsdaT5AVtaQe"],"extracted_files":["data/raw/extracted/Peking University/Fact Sheet PKU 2020-2021 (updated).pdf.txt"],"local_files":["data/raw/factsheets/Peking University/Fact Sheet PKU 2020-2021 (updated).pdf"],"match_status":"matched","notes":"Excel Col H blank, but matching public folder found in Drive master folder"},"fall_term_dates":{"notes":"General PKU Fall semester runs early September through mid-January.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Peking University/Fact Sheet PKU 2020-2021 (updated).pdf#page=2","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"partial","value":"AY 2020-2021 reference calendar (Fact Sheet p.2; check http://www.pku.edu.cn/campuslife/xl/index.htm for 2026-27 dates): Autumn semester Sep 14 - Jan 17."},"final_semester_allowed":{"notes":"PKU Fact Sheet p.3 states: ''Students in the graduate year at home university are NOT recommended to apply'' (not an explicit absolute ban).","source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"host_grants_or_stipends":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"host_language_requirement":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Peking University/Fact Sheet PKU 2020-2021 (updated).pdf#page=3","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"Chinese HSK Level 6 (over 70 points per item) required for Chinese-taught UG/GR courses; NO Chinese proficiency required for Chinese language training courses."},"housing_availability":{"notes":"If covered by bilateral exchange agreement, a shared room at Zhongguanyuan Global Village is automatically allocated upon arrival; otherwise students apply online via studyatpku.com in mid-Jul / mid-Jan (~3,300-4,500 RMB/mo) or rent off campus (~2,000-5,000 RMB/mo).","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Peking University/Fact Sheet PKU 2020-2021 (updated).pdf#page=4","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"assisted"},"housing_notes":{"notes":"Monthly rent rates and booking timeline on data/raw/factsheets/Peking University/Fact Sheet PKU 2020-2021 (updated).pdf#page=5.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Peking University/Fact Sheet PKU 2020-2021 (updated).pdf#page=4","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"Global Village (Zhong Guan Xin Yuan) on-campus dorms ~3,300-4,500 RMB/month (shared facilities, automatic if agreement covers free dorms; else online booking mid-Jul/mid-Jan via studyatpku.com); off-campus ~2,000-5,000 RMB/month (Ziroom/BeijingBuddy)."},"instruction_languages":{"notes":"Courses primarily taught in Chinese at UG/Master levels; select English-taught courses offered.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Peking University/Fact Sheet PKU 2020-2021 (updated).pdf#page=3","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":["Chinese","English"]},"international_support_services":{"notes":"Orientation and ISD services on p.4-5.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Peking University/Fact Sheet PKU 2020-2021 (updated).pdf#page=1","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"Office of International Relations (OIR, exchange@pku.edu.cn) and International Students Division (ISD Room 330 New Sun Student Center, study@pku.edu.cn) handle nominations, Global Village dorm placement, orientation Chinese placement interviews, and visa documents."},"living_cost_usd_est":{"notes":"Midpoint CNY 2,000/month (1,000-3,000 CNY/month excluding accommodation) * 5 months = CNY 10,000; converted at ECB 2026-11-13 rate (collected 2026-11-15) 1 EUR = 7.3738 CNY & 1 EUR = 1.1052 USD -> 1 CNY = 0.14988201 USD (https://www.ecb.europa.eu/stats/policy_and_exchange_rates/euro_reference_exchange_rates/html/index.en.html) = 1,498.82 USD (excludes dorm 3,300-4,500 CNY/mo unless covered by bilateral agreement).","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Peking University/Fact Sheet PKU 2020-2021 (updated).pdf#page=5","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"partial","value":1498.82},"mandatory_host_fees_and_insurance":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Peking University/Fact Sheet PKU 2020-2021 (updated).pdf#page=5","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"Application, tuition, and administrative fees normally waived under bilateral agreements. Exchange students MUST purchase the designated Chinese medical insurance plan at CNY 400 per semester."},"min_gpa_host":{"notes":"No fixed numeric host GPA cutoff appears in PKU Fact Sheet 2020-21 or on verified PKU web pages.","source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"min_standing_note":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Peking University/Fact Sheet PKU 2020-2021 (updated).pdf#page=3","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"Applicants must have completed at least the first year of their current study programme during the exchange, remain registered at home university, be non-Chinese citizens aged 18-45 (graduate-year students are not recommended to apply)."},"nomination_deadlines":{"notes":"2026-27 web cycle retains Mar 30 / Apr 15 and Oct 30 / Nov 15.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Peking University/Fact Sheet PKU 2020-2021 (updated).pdf#page=2","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"Autumn / Full Year: Nomination deadline March 30; Online application Feb 20 - Apr 15. Spring Semester: Nomination deadline October 30; Online application Sep 20 - Nov 15."},"official_name":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:85","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"Peking University"},"official_website_url":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:85","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"http://english.pku.edu.cn/"},"region":{"notes":"From normalized manifest country/region mapping","source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:85","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"East Asia"},"required_application_docs":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Peking University/Fact Sheet PKU 2020-2021 (updated).pdf#page=2","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":["Home university email nomination + official paper nomination letter","Completed PKU online application (studyatpku.com)","Original English-version hard copies mailed via home international office","Language proof if required (HSK 6 for Chinese-taught degree courses)"]},"schema_version":"1.0.0","seat_quota":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"shard":5,"short_name":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Peking University/Fact Sheet PKU 2020-2021 (updated).pdf#page=3","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"PKU"},"slug":"peking-university","spring_term_dates":{"notes":"General PKU Spring semester runs late February through late June.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Peking University/Fact Sheet PKU 2020-2021 (updated).pdf#page=2","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"partial","value":"AY 2020-2021 reference calendar (Fact Sheet p.2; check http://www.pku.edu.cn/campuslife/xl/index.htm for 2026-27 dates): Spring semester Feb 22 - Jun 27."},"state_or_province":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"tuition_model":{"notes":"Fact sheet p.5 states: ''Normally exchange students do not pay any application, tuition or administrative fees as per the university bilateral agreement.'' Verified on isd.pku.edu.cn.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Peking University/Fact Sheet PKU 2020-2021 (updated).pdf#page=5","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"auc_exchange_waiver"},"visa_lead_time_and_financial_proof":{"notes":"PKU 2020-21 Fact Sheet p.1/p.5 references ISD (http://www.isd.pku.edu.cn/) for incoming student visa onboarding; exact live pku.edu.cn visa subpage URL was not surfaced in plain text (X1/X2 student visa & JW201/JW202 rules managed via ISD).","source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null}}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO universities (slug, excel_rows_json, shard, fact_sheet_match_status, fact_sheet_files_json, cross_references_json, official_name, short_name, country, state_or_province, city, region, agreement_status, agreement_student_levels_json, min_standing_note, agreement_scope_raw, eligible_auc_schools_json, eligible_majors_json, excluded_majors_json, min_gpa_host, instruction_languages_json, english_course_availability, english_proficiency_and_rhet1020, host_language_requirement, available_terms_json, fall_term_dates, spring_term_dates, final_semester_allowed, seat_quota, tuition_model, est_monthly_living_currency, est_monthly_living_min, est_monthly_living_max, living_cost_usd_est, living_cost_usd_est_status, mandatory_host_fees_and_insurance, housing_availability, housing_notes, host_grants_or_stipends, citizenship_restrictions, visa_lead_time_and_financial_proof, official_website_url, exchange_page_url, course_catalog_url, english_course_list_url, credit_system_and_load, course_restrictions_note, required_application_docs_json, academic_style, city_tier, campus_type, daily_life_english_friendliness, international_support_services, nomination_deadlines, ext_json, metadata_json) VALUES ('pforzheim-university', '[86]', 6, 'matched', '["data/raw/factsheets/Pforzeim University/2025-2026/Courses in English.docx","data/raw/factsheets/Pforzeim University/2025-2026/FactSheet_HS_PF_Exchange_2025_2026.pdf"]', '[]', 'Pforzheim University', NULL, 'Germany', NULL, 'Pforzheim', 'Europe', 'active', '["UG"]', NULL, 'Industrial Engineering only in English as a full semester, the rest of engineering is mix + business school.', '["BUS","SSE"]', '["Industrial Engineering","Engineering","Business"]', NULL, NULL, '["English","German"]', 'substantial', 'Minimum B2 CEFR in English: TOEFL iBT >85 (CBT >235, ITP >570), IELTS >=6.5, or TOEIC/PTE/CPE/DTE >=110. No RHET 1020 waiver stated.', 'B2 German required if taking German-taught courses (TestDaF >16 with min 4 in each part, DSH 2, Goethe C2, or telc C1 Hochschule); free in-semester German A1–C1 + optional 4-week pre-semester course (5 ECTS).', '["Fall","Spring"]', 'Winter Semester: begins last week of September; classes & exams end early February (Fast Track pre-Christmas exam option available).', 'Summer Semester: begins 2nd week of March; classes & exams end mid-July.', NULL, NULL, 'auc_exchange_waiver', 'EUR', 800.0, 800.0, 4420.8, 'partial', 'Studierendenwerk student service fee €112/semester (includes free Pforzheim local public transit) + €20 student ID card; adequate health insurance required.', 'off_campus_only', 'Self-arranged housing (recommended student residences €220–€400/month via https://www.hs-pforzheim.de/en/international/studying_in_pforzheim/general_information/housing).', NULL, NULL, 'Non-EU citizens must obtain a German student visa in advance (tourist visas cannot be converted); processing takes up to 3 months.', 'https://engineeringpf.hs-pforzheim.de/', 'https://www.hs-pforzheim.de/en/international/studying_in_pforzheim/exchange_students', NULL, 'https://businesspf.hs-pforzheim.de/international/international_study_program_isp/information_for_incoming_bachelor_exchange_students/business_courses_in_english', 'ECTS; minimum 24 ECTS, recommended 30 ECTS, maximum 36 ECTS per semester; German grading scale 1.0–4.0 pass (4.3–5.0 fail).', 'Business School ISP offers >60 bachelor-level courses taught in English (prerequisites: >=1 year UG Business/Accounting/Economics + Statistics/Calculus and B2 English); per AUC agreement (rows:86), Industrial Engineering can be taken as a full semester in English while other Engineering majors are mixed English/German.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Winter Semester: Nomination May 1, Application May 15; Summer Semester: Nomination Oct 1, Application Oct 15.', '{}', '{"academic_style":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"agreement_scope_raw":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/