stmas break Dec 19, 2026-Jan 6, 2027.', 'AY 2026-2027 Term 2 (Winter): Welcome Jan 8, 2027; Teaching begins Jan 7-11; Easter break Mar 20-29, 2027; Exams mid/late Mar-early Apr 2027. Term 3 (Spring): Apr-Jun 2027.', NULL, NULL, 'auc_exchange_waiver', 'EUR', 800, 1350, 5940.45, 'partial', 'Mandatory accident, travel, and health insurance coverage valid in Spain required for all incoming exchange students (cost varies by provider).', 'assisted', 'BCU Housing Service (https://www.bcuhousing.cat/en) and partner residence agreements: shared flat €800-€1,050/month; student residence hall €950-€1,350/month (total monthly living estimate).', NULL, NULL, 'Non-EU students staying >3 months MUST obtain a Spanish student visa prior to arrival (tourist visas cannot be converted); guide at https://www.upf.edu/barcelona. Lead time/exact solvency threshold not specified in fact sheet.', 'https://www.upf.edu/', 'https://www.upf.edu/web/international/', 'https://www.upf.edu/web/incoming/exchange-students-academic-information', NULL, 'ECTS (trimester system): normal full load is 20 ECTS per trimester (60 ECTS/year); max 20 ECTS/term (25 in Term 1). Spanish 0-10 grading scale (5 pass).', 'Max 1 course/term from outside your assigned host faculty (p. 3); Final Year Projects (TFG) and certain practical internships are excluded from exchange enrollment (per upf.edu).', '["Home university nomination","Online registration / exchange application","Language proficiency proof (Spanish/Catalan B1 or English B2)","Mandatory accident, travel, and health insurance policy","Passport / Spanish student visa (>3 months non-EU)"]', 'Public university (12,400 students) operating on a fast-paced 3-trimester calendar (10 weeks instruction + 2 weeks exams per term) with 0-10 grading.', NULL, 'multi_campus', NULL, 'Mobility and Welcome Office (OMA), Language Volunteering tandem program, reduced-fee Idiomes UPF Spanish/Catalan courses, and BCU Housing assistance.', 'Term 1 (Fall): Nomination Apr 30, Registration May 20; Term 2 & Term 3: Nomination Sep 30, Registration Oct 20.', '{}', '{"academic_style":{"notes":"Trimester structure and grading detailed on Factsheet UPF_2026_ER.pdf#page=2.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Universitat Pompeu Fabra (UPF)/2026/Factsheet UPF_2026_ER.pdf#page=1","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"Public university (12,400 students) operating on a fast-paced 3-trimester calendar (10 weeks instruction + 2 weeks exams per term) with 0-10 grading."},"agreement_scope_raw":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:89,127","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"Global Studies and Humanities"},"agreement_status":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:89,127","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"active"},"agreement_student_levels":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:89,127","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":["UG","GR"]},"available_terms":{"notes":"Fall/Spring","source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:89,127","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":["Fall","Spring"]},"campus_type":{"notes":"Three urban campuses in Barcelona: Ciutadella, Poblenou, and Mar.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Universitat Pompeu Fabra (UPF)/2026/Factsheet UPF_2026_ER.pdf#page=1","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"multi_campus"},"citizenship_restrictions":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"city":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:89,127","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"Barcelona"},"city_tier":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"country":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json