duate Exchange Fact Sheet.pdf#page=4","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"Mandatory automatic enrollment in University Health Insurance Plan (UHIP) for international/exchange students (~CAD $264/1 term or CAD $528/2 terms per 2026-27 factsheets; transcripts held if UHIP balance owed). Student card includes Kingston Transit."},"min_gpa_host":{"notes":"Queen''s incoming exchange relies on partner university nomination benchmarks (note: the 2.7/2.8 cGPA figures on queensu.ca/international/bilateral-exchange-program govern outgoing Queen''s students).","source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"min_standing_note":{"notes":"Home university nomination & academic standing noted on https://www.queensu.ca/international/incoming-exchange.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Queens University/2026-2027/Queen′s University - Arts and Science Exchange Fact Sheet.pdf#page=9","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"Must be nominated by home partner university in good/competitive academic standing (Smith Commerce notes partner selection; Queen''s uses a 4.3 grading scale)."},"nomination_deadlines":{"notes":"Same deadlines confirmed on Smith Commerce Fact Sheet #page=2.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Queens University/2026-2027/Queen′s University - Arts and Science Exchange Fact Sheet.pdf#page=4","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"Fall / Full Year: nomination April 1, application April 30. Winter: early nomination April 1 / final nomination September 1, final application September 30 (fixed annual dates)."},"official_name":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:90","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"Queen''s University at Kingston"},"official_website_url":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:90","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"https://www.queensu.ca/"},"region":{"notes":"From normalized manifest country/region mapping","source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:90","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"North America"},"required_application_docs":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"schema_version":"1.0.0","seat_quota":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"shard":8,"short_name":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"slug":"queen-s-university-at-kingston","spring_term_dates":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Queens University/2026-2027/Queen′s University - Arts and Science Exchange Fact Sheet.pdf#page=4","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"2027-01-15 to 2027-04-23 (Winter term: classes Jan 15–Apr 5; exams Apr 9–23, 2027; orientation Jan 2027)"},"state_or_province":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:90","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"Ontario"},"tuition_model":{"notes":"Incoming bilateral exchange students pay regular tuition to their home university and do not pay tuition fees to Queen''s.","source_ref":"https://www.queensu.ca/international/incoming-exchange/costs","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":"auc_exchange_waiver"},"visa_lead_time_and_financial_proof":{"notes":"Same rule stated on Smith Commerce Fact Sheet #page=4.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Queens University/2026-2027/Queen′s University - Arts and Science Exchange Fact Sheet.pdf#page=13","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"Single-semester exchange (<6 months) can enter as a visitor (TRV or eTA, no Canadian Study Permit required); stays of 6 months or more (full-year) require a Canadian Study Permit."}}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO universities (slug, excel_rows_json, shard, fact_sheet_match_status, fact_sheet_files_json, cross_references_json, official_name, short_name, country, state_or_province, city, region, agreement_status, agreement_student_levels_json, min_standing_note, agreement_scope_raw, eligible_auc_schools_json, eligible_majors_json, excluded_majors_json, min_gpa_host, instruction_languages_json, english_course_availability, english_proficiency_and_rhet1020, host_language_requirement, available_terms_json, fall_term_dates, spring_term_dates, final_semester_allowed, seat_quota, tuition_model, est_monthly_living_currency, est_monthly_living_min, est_monthly_living_max, living_cost_usd_est, living_cost_usd_est_status, mandatory_host_fees_and_insurance, housing_availability, housing_notes, host_grants_or_stipends, citizenship_restrictions, visa_lead_time_and_financial_proof, official_website_url, exchange_page_url, course_catalog_url, english_course_list_url, credit_system_and_load, course_restrictions_note, required_application_docs_json, academic_style, city_tier, campus_type, daily_life_english_friendliness, international_support_services, nomination_deadlines, ext_json, metadata_json) VALUES ('radboud-university', '[91]', 1, 'matched', '["data/raw/factsheets/Radboud University/2025-2026/Radboud University Student Datasheet 2025 2026.pdf","data/raw/factsheets/Radboud University/Radboud University Student Datasheet 2024 2025 v3.pdf","data/raw/factsheets/Radboud University/Radboud University Student Datasheet 2024 2025__1eP4W8.pdf","data/raw/factsheets/Radboud University/Radboud University Student Datasheet 2024 2025__1xcOpH.pdf","data/raw/factsheets/Radboud University/Radboud University Student Datasheet 2025 2026.pdf"]', '[]', 'Radboud University', 'RU', 'Netherlands', NULL, 'Nijmegen', 'Europe', 'active', '["UG","GR"]', NULL, 'University-wide', '["ALL"]', '["ALL"]', NULL, NULL, '["English","Dutch"]', 'substantial', 'Minimum CEFR B2 English required (C1 required for English Language & Culture Dept and Nijmegen School of Management Master''s courses). Non-EEA exchange students must submit official test scores unless exempt: IELTS >=6.0 (no IELTS Online; Arts/English require 6.5) or TOEFL iBT >=80 (no Home Edition) per https://www.ru.nl/en/studying-at-radboud-university/application-and-admission/language-requirements/english-language-test-results-for-exchange-students. No RHET 1020 exemption stated.', 'None for English-taught courses; free social Dutch language course offered on campus (limited spots).', '["Fall","Spring"]', 'Semester 1 (AY 2026-2027): Mon 31 Aug 2026 - Fri 22 Jan 2027 (Period 1 classes 31 Aug - 16 Oct, exams 19-30 Oct; Period 2 classes 2 Nov - 18 Dec, exams 4-22 Jan 2027). Orientation mid/late Aug.', 'Semester 2 (AY 2026-2027): Mon 25 Jan 2027 - Fri 9 Jul 2027 (Period 3: 25 Jan - 2 Apr 2027; Period 4: 5 Apr - 9 Jul 2027). Orientation late Jan.', NULL, NULL, 'auc_exchange_waiver', 'EUR', 1000, 1200, 6078.6, 'partial', 'Mandatory Health, Legal Liability, and Travel insurance required during exchange stay.', 'assisted', 'Housing assistance available via housing@ru.nl, but rooms are limited and NOT guaranteed; apply promptly upon admission.', NULL, NULL, 'Radboud Admissions submits Schengen entry visa (MVV) and residence permit (VVR) applications for non-EEA students; non-EEA students must enroll in >=20 ECTS on their Learning Agreement.', 'http://www.ru.nl/io/english', 'https://www.ru.nl/exchangestudents/admission', 'https://www.ru.nl/en/education/more-education-and-training/exchange-students/exchange-courses', NULL, 'ECTS (Dutch 1-10 grading scale; 6.0 minimum pass); non-EEA visa holders must take minimum >=20 ECTS per semester on Learning Agreement (typical full load 30 ECTS).', NULL, '["Home university nomination + online application","Learning Agreement (>=20 ECTS minimum for non-EEA visa students)","Official English test certificate (non-EEA unless exempt)","Proof of mandatory Health, Liability & Travel insurance"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Free social Dutch language course (limited spots), Admissions visa/MVV/VVR sponsorship, and housing assistance (housing@ru.nl).', 'Semester 1 (Fall): Nomination 1 May, Application 23 May. Semester 2 (Spring): Nomination 1 November, Application 23 November.', '{}', '{"academic_style":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"agreement_scope_raw":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:91","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"University-wide"},"agreement_status":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:91","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"active"},"agreement_student_levels":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:91","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":["UG","GR"]},"available_terms":{"notes":"Fall/Spring","source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:91","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":["Fall","Spring"]},"campus_type":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"citizenship_restrictions":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"city":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:91","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"Nijmegen"},"city_tier":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"country":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:91","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"Netherlands"},"course_catalog_url":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"https://www.ru.nl/en/education/more-education-and-training/exchange-students/exchange-courses","source_type":"official_web","status":"