tuition list price is $38,420/yr).","source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"visa_lead_time_and_financial_proof":{"notes":"Visa process portal: https://www.roanoke.edu/inside/a-z_index/international_student_services/visa_process.","source_ref":"https://www.roanoke.edu/inside/a-z_index/international_student_services/admitted_students","source_type":"official_web","status":"partial","value":"International students coordinate visa sponsorship via International Student Services (I-20 for F-1 status or DS-2019 for J-1 sponsored exchange students such as ISEP)."}}');
