 beginner ES-E5 Japanese language classes (up to 8 credits/semester)."},"housing_availability":{"notes":"International student dormitories preferentially house exchange students (fee waivers may apply depending on bilateral agreement; 2022 Fact Sheet #page=7 noted dormitories fee-exempt for exchange students).","source_ref":"https://www.soka.ac.jp/en/admissions/accommodation","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":"assisted"},"housing_notes":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"https://www.soka.ac.jp/en/admissions/accommodation","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":"International dormitories preferentially house exchange students (https://www.soka.ac.jp/en/admissions/accommodation): Takiyama International Dormitory (on campus, single rooms, JPY 224,000/sem), Hoyu Dormitory (male, ~20 min walk, twin rooms, JPY 184,000/sem), plus Cosmos / Yuko / Manyo dormitories for female students. Standard entrance fee JPY 50,000; bilateral agreements may waive dorm fees (2022 Fact Sheet #page=7 noted dormitories fee-exempt for exchange students). Optional dorm cafeteria meal plan (Mon-Sat breakfast & dinner): JPY 24,300/month on soka.ac.jp (JPY 22,500/month in 2022 Fact Sheet #page=7)."},"instruction_languages":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"https://www.soka.ac.jp/en/admissions/exchange-program-inbound","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":["English","Japanese"]},"international_support_services":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"living_cost_usd_est":{"notes":"Cannot be derived without an official Soka University all-in monthly living cost range.","source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"mandatory_host_fees_and_insurance":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"min_gpa_host":{"notes":"Soka University inbound exchange FAQs note no strict central institutional minimum GPA requirement (relies on partner home nomination).","source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"min_standing_note":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"nomination_deadlines":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"https://www.soka.ac.jp/en/admissions/exchange-program-inbound","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":"Fall semester (Sep entry): Nomination 15 Mar, Application 31 Mar. Spring semester (Apr entry): Nomination 15 Oct, Application 31 Oct."},"official_name":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:100","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"Soka University"},"official_website_url":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:100","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"https://www.soka.ac.jp/"},"region":{"notes":"From normalized manifest country/region mapping","source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:100","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"East Asia"},"required_application_docs":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"https://www.soka.ac.jp/en/admissions/exchange-program-inbound","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":["Home university nomination + online application (soka-exchange.campus-p.jp)","Official academic transcript","Certificate of enrollment from home institution","Faculty/staff letter of recommendation","Language proficiency certificate (TOEFL/IELTS for English track or JLPT N2 for Japanese track)","Financial support evidence (>= JPY 300,000 / 1 sem or JPY 600,000 / 2 sem)","Passport ID page copy & immigration headshot photo"]},"schema_version":"1.0.0","seat_quota":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"shard":1,"short_name":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"slug":"soka-university","spring_term_dates":