-3 attestation).', 'English (US university; see english_proficiency_and_rhet1020).', '["Fall","Spring"]', 'Fall 2026: Arrival Aug 25, 2026; Orientation Aug 26-30, 2026; Classes Aug 31-Dec 18, 2026.', 'Spring 2027: Arrival Jan 20, 2027; Orientation Jan 21-24, 2027; Classes Jan 25-May 15, 2027 (fact sheet p.1 has a ''2026'' typo on May 15 end date under Spring 2027).', NULL, NULL, 'auc_exchange_waiver', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'unknown', 'USD 0 tuition; mandatory SUNY UHC health insurance USD 908/semester; mandatory College fees USD 902/semester.', 'assisted', 'West Campus Apartments USD 4,530/semester (no meal plan required) or DeGroat Hall USD 4,580 double / USD 5,315 single (requires USD 3,475 meal plan); break housing included free; est books USD 500/sem + est personal USD 2,000/sem (p.3).', NULL, NULL, 'F-1 or J-1 visa required; applicants must submit FSA-4 financial verification form with supporting bank statement (exact minimum proof total not stated in PDF).', 'http://www2.cortland.edu/home/', 'https://www2.cortland.edu/offices/international-programs/', 'https://banner.cortland.edu/StudentRegistrationSsb/ssb/term/termSelection?mode=search', NULL, NULL, NULL, '["Academic transcripts","English proficiency proof (FSA-3 form or Duolingo/IELTS/TOEFL)","250-word essay","Passport copy","FSA-4 financial form with bank statement","TB and immunization forms"]', NULL, 'college_town', NULL, NULL, 'Free Syracuse (SYR) airport pickup on official arrival day and 4-5 day incoming orientation.', 'AY 2026-2027 application deadlines: Fall May 8; Spring Nov 1.', '{}', '{"academic_style":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"agreement_scope_raw":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:102","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"University-wide"},"agreement_status":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:102","source_ty