ly via Vestide or private Eindhoven rentals (~EUR 400 room to EUR 700 studio/month per TU/e factsheet)."},"instruction_languages":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"https://www.tue.nl/en/education/tue-graduate-school/exchange-ieis","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":["English","Dutch"]},"international_support_services":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"https://www.tue.nl/en/education/tue-education-guide/practical-info/information-for-international-students","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":"TU/e International Programs Office, Mobility-Online nomination/application portal, collective IND immigration processing."},"living_cost_usd_est":{"notes":"5-month midpoint estimate: 916.5 EUR/month * 5 months = 4,582.5 EUR * 1.1052 USD/EUR = 5,064.58 USD (ECB 2026-11-13 rate, collected 2026-11-15: https://www.ecb.europa.eu/stats/policy_and_exchange_rates/euro_reference_exchange_rates/html/index.en.html).","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Technische Universiteit Eindhoven (TUE)/Technische Universiteit Eindhoven (TUE).docx","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"partial","value":5064.6},"mandatory_host_fees_and_insurance":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/Technische Universiteit Eindhoven (TUE)/Technische Universiteit Eindhoven (TUE).docx","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"Health and liability insurance are mandatory in the Netherlands (recommended Aon ICS Complete+ via www.aonstudentinsurance.com/tue for non-EU students unless home coverage meets equivalent Dutch terms)."},"min_gpa_host":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"min_standing_note":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"nomination_deadlines":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"official_name":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:108","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"Technische Universiteit Eindhoven (TUE)"},"official_website_url":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:108","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"https://www.tue.nl/en/"},"region":{"notes":"From normalized manifest country/region mapping","source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:108","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"Europe"},"required_application_docs":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"schema_version":"1.0.0","seat_quota":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"shard":8,"short_name":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:108","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"TUE"},"slug":"technische-universiteit-eindhoven-tue","spring_term_dates":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"https://www.tue.nl/en/education/tue-education-guide/practical-info/academic-year-agenda","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":"2027-02 to 2027-07-03 (AY 2026-2027 Semester B / Quartiles 3–4; Q3 exams Apr 5–17; Q4 classes Apr 19–Jun 18; Q4 exams Jun 21–Jul 3, 2027)"},"state_or_province":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"tuition_model":{"notes":"Incoming exchange students nominated under a formal partnership agreement are exempt from TU/e tuition fees (unlike free movers).","source_ref":"https://www.tue.nl/en/education/practical-info/financial-matters/tuition-fees-living-expenses","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":"auc_exchange_waiver"},"visa_lead_time_and_financial_proof":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"https://www.tue.nl/en/education/tue-education-guide/practical-info/information-for-international-students","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":"Non-EEA students require an MVV entry visa and/or VVR residence permit processed collectively through TU/e International Office with IND proof of sufficient monthly financial means (deposit to TU/e or full-cost scholarship)."}}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO universities (slug, excel_rows_json, shard, fact_sheet_match_status, fact_sheet_files_json, cross_references_json, official_name, short_name, country, state_or_province, city, region, agreement_status, agreement_student_levels_json, min_standing_note, agreement_scope_raw, eligible_auc_schools_json, eligible_majors_json, excluded_majors_json, min_gpa_host, instruction_languages_json, english_course_availability, english_proficiency_and_rhet1020, host_language_requirement, available_terms_json, fall_term_dates, spring_term_dates, final_semester_allowed, seat_quota, tuition_model, est_monthly_living_currency, est_monthly_living_min, est_monthly_living_max, living_cost_usd_est, living_cost_usd_est_status, mandatory_host_fees_and_insurance, housing_availability, housing_notes, host_grants_or_stipends, citizenship_restrictions, visa_lead_time_and_financial_proof, official_website_url, exchange_page_url, course_catalog_url, english_course_list_url, credit_system_and_load, course_restrictions_note, required_application_docs_json, academic_style, city_tier, campus_type, daily_life_english_friendliness, international_support_services, nomination_deadlines, ext_json, metadata_json) VALUES ('the-american-college-of-greece-acg', '[109]', 1, 'matched', '["data/raw/factsheets/ACG- The American College of Greece/2026-2027/Academic Calendar 2026_2027_Study Abroad.pdf","data/raw/factsheets/ACG- The American College of Greece/Exchange Partner Info Sheet.pdf"]', '[]', 'The American College of Greece (ACG)', 'ACG', 'Greece', NULL, 'Athens', 'Europe', 'active', '["UG","GR"]', 'Minimum 30 earned university credits and a declared major required for incoming exchange admission.', 'University-wide', '["ALL"]', '["ALL"]', NULL, 2.5, '["English"]', 'full', 'Proof of English proficiency required for non-native speakers per Exchange Partner Info Sheet #page=1 (specific test cutoffs or RHET 1020 exemption not enumerated in local fact sheets).', 'None required (courses taught in American English).', '["Fall","Spring","Summer"]', 'Fall 2026: Move-in 6-7 Sep, Orientation 9 Sep, Classes 10 Sep - 9 Dec, Finals 11-18 Dec, Move-out 19 Dec 2026 (Fall Intensive: 15 Oct - 19 Dec 2026).', 'Spring 2027: Move-in 10-11 Jan, Orientation 12 Jan, Classes 14 Jan - 14 Apr, Finals 16-23 Apr, Move-out 24 Apr 2027 (also Summer 2027 Term 16 May - 15 Jul; Sessions I & II May-Jul).', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'unknown', 'Tuition & fees per bilateral agreement (Exchange Partner Info Sheet #page=2); ACG budgets ~EUR 300/semester for books and ~EUR 3,000/semester for personal/meals/transport excluding housing (https://www.acg.edu/admissions/study-abroad/inbound-study-abroad/tuition-fees-non-us-students/).', 'assisted', 'Furnished apartments in Aghia Paraskevi with equipped kitchens managed via ACG Study Abroad Housing (https://www.acg.edu/admissions/study-abroad/inbound-study-abroad/housing-at-acg/; check-in/out aligned to semester move-in/move-out calendar).', NULL, NULL, 'Greek student visa process should begin ~10 weeks prior to term start (Exchange Partner Info Sheet #page=2; guidance at https://www.acg.edu/admissions/student-visa).', 'http://www.acg.edu/', 'https://www.acg.edu/admissions/study-abroad/study-in-greece/', NULL, NULL, 'US credit system (NEASC + OU UK accredited; 128 credits/BA, most courses 3 credits); maximum load 15 credits in Fall/Spring and 6 credits in Summer.', NULL, '["Online application form","1 faculty recommendation letter","Official academic transcript","Proof of English proficiency","Copy of passport"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Mandatory orientation before classes (#page=2; 9 Sep 2026 Fall / 12 Jan 2027 Spring / 18 May 2027 Summer) and student visa support.', 'Rolling admissions deadlines (start application early enough to allow ~10 weeks before classes for Greek student visa processing).', '{}', '{"academic_style":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"agreement_sc