, and medical repatriation for the entire mobility stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://www.unl.pt/en', 'https://www.fct.unl.pt/en/international/incoming-students-mobilities', NULL, NULL, 'ECTS: standard load up to 31.5 ECTS/semester at Nova SBE (30 ECTS recommended at NOVA FCT per fct.unl.pt).', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'multi_campus', NULL, NULL, 'Decentralized by NOVA faculty: NOVA FCT (1st sem/FY nom May 31 / app Jun 30; 2nd sem nom Oct 31 / app Nov 30); NOVA FCSH (nom May 31 for 1st/2nd sem/FY; Oct 31 for 2nd sem); NOVA Law (May 31 Autumn / Nov 30 Spring); Nova SBE (Fall Feb 20–Apr 20 nom / Apr 27 app; Spring Jul 20–Sep 20 nom).', '{}', '{"academic_style":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"agreement_scope_raw":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"agreement_status":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:125","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"active"},"agreement_student_levels":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"available_terms":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"campus_type":{"notes":"Decentralized campuses across Greater Lisbon: Campolide (Central Lisbon), Caparica (Almada — FCT), Carcavelos (Nova SBE), and downtown Lisbon (Medical/FCSH).","source_ref":"https://www.novaims.unl.pt/en/education/programs/erasmus-incoming","source_type":"official_web","status":"partial","value":"multi_campus"},"citizenship_restrictions":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"city":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:125","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"Lisbon"},"city_tier":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"country":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:125","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"Portugal"},"course_catalog_url":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"course_restrictions_note":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"credit_system_and_load":{"notes":"NOVA FCT reference at https://www.fct.unl.pt/en/student/student-orientation-and-mobility/erasmus-student-mobility-studies-sms.","source_ref":"https://www.novasbe.unl.pt/en/programs/exchanges/incoming-exchange-students","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":"ECTS: standard load up to 31.5 ECTS/semester at Nova SBE (30 ECTS recommended at NOVA FCT per fct.unl.pt)."},"cross_references":["nova-school-of-business-and-economics-nova-sbe"],"daily_life_english_friendliness":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"eligible_auc_schools":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"eligible_majors":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"english_course_availability":{"notes":"Varies by decentralized NOVA faculty: NOVA SBE (cross-referenced), NOVA IMS, and NOVA School of Law offer English tracks; NOVA FCSH and NOVA FCT undergraduate teaching is primarily Portuguese with select English electives/graduate courses.","source_ref":"https://novalaw.unl.pt/en/education/incoming-students/","source_type":"official_web","status":"partial","value":"substantial"},"english_course_list_url":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"english_proficiency_and_rhet1020":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"est_monthly_living_local":{"notes":"Sum of NOVA FCT published monthly Lisbon-area items: room rent EUR 250–500 + food/groceries ~EUR 250 + public transport pass EUR 40 + telecom ~EUR 25 = EUR 565–815/month (excluding misc/leisure; subsidized canteen meals ~EUR 3–4).","source_ref":"https://www.fct.unl.pt/en/international/studying-and-living-portugal/cost-living","source_type":"official_web","status":"partial","value":{"currency":"EUR","max":815,"min":565}},"excel_rows":[125],"exchange_page_url":{"notes":"Mobility is decentralized across NOVA schools (see also cross-referenced Nova SBE, plus NOVA IMS, NOVA Law, NOVA FCSH, NMS).","source_ref":"https://www.fct.unl.pt/en/international/incoming-students-mobilities","source_type":"official_web","status":"partial","value":"https://www.fct.unl.pt/en/international/incoming-students-mobilities"},"excluded_majors":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"ext":{},"fact_sheet_status":{"drive_links":[],"extracted_files":[],"local_files":[],"match_status":"none","notes":null},"fall_term_dates":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"final_semester_allowed":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"host_grants_or_stipends":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"host_language_requirement":{"notes":"School portals: https://www.fcsh.unl.pt/en/current-students/incoming-students/ and https://www.fct.unl.pt/en/student/student-orientation-and-mobility/erasmus-student-mobility-studies-sms.","source_ref":"https://novalaw.unl.pt/en/education/incoming-students/","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":"Varies by NOVA faculty: NOVA Law requires Portuguese B1 (or English B2); NOVA FCSH requires Portuguese A2 for Portuguese-taught study (offers pre-term/semester Portuguese courses); NOVA FCT requires Portuguese A2 or English B1."},"housing_availability":{"notes":"Housing support is handled per NOVA school without a single consolidated university-wide housing policy across unl.pt portals.","source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"housing_notes":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"instruction_languages":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"https://www.fct.unl.pt/en/international/incoming-students-mobilities","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":["Portuguese","English"]},"international_support_services":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"living_cost_usd_est":{"notes":"5-month midpoint estimate: 690 EUR/month * 5 months = 3,450 EUR * 1.1052 USD/EUR = 3,812.94 USD (ECB 2026-11-13 rate, collected 2026-11-15: https://www.ecb.europa.eu/stats/policy_and_exchange_rates/euro_reference_exchange_rates/html/index.en.html).","source_ref":"https://www.fct.unl.pt/en/international/studying-and-living-portugal/cost-living","source_type":"official_web","status":"partial","value":3812.9},"mandatory_host_fees_and_insurance":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"https://www.novaims.unl.pt/en/education/programs/erasmus-incoming","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":"EU/EEA/Swiss students require valid EHIC; non-EU incoming exchange students must hold private international health insurance (certificate in English) covering medical expenses, treatment, and medical repatriation for the entire mobility stay."},"min_gpa_host":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"min_standing_note":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"nomination_deadlines":{"notes":"Confirmed on https://www.fcsh.unl.pt/en/current-students/incoming-students/, https://novalaw.unl.pt/en/education/incoming-students/, and https://www.novasbe.unl.pt/en/programs/exchanges/incoming-exchange-students.","source_ref":"https://www.fct.unl.pt/en/student/student-orientation-and-mobility/erasmus-student-mobility-studies-sms","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":"Decentralized by NOVA faculty: NOVA FCT (1st sem/FY nom May 31 / app Jun 30; 2nd sem nom Oct 31 / app Nov 30); NOVA FCSH (nom May 31 for 1st/2nd sem/FY; Oct 31 for 2nd sem); NOVA Law (May 31 Autumn / Nov 30 Spring); Nova SBE (Fall Feb 20–Apr 20 nom / Apr 27 app; Spring Jul 20–Sep 20 nom)."},"official_name":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:125","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"Universidade Nova de Lisboa"},"official_website_url":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:125","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"https://www.unl.pt/en"},"region":{"notes":"From normalized manifest country/region mapping","source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:125","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"Europe"},"required_application_docs":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"schema_version":"1.0.0","seat_quota":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"shard":8,"short_name":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"https://www.unl.pt/en","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":"NOVA"},"slug":"universidade-nova-de-lisboa","spring_term_dates":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"state_or_province":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"tuition_model":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"visa_lead_time_and_financial_proof":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null}}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO universities (slug, excel_rows_json, shard, fact_sheet_match_status, fact_sheet_files_json, cross_references_json, official_name, short_name, country, state_or_province, city, region, agreement_status, agreement_student_levels_json, min_standing_note, agreement_scope_raw, eligible_auc_schools_json, eligible_majors_json, excluded_majors_json, min_gpa_host, instruction_languages_json, english_course_availability, english_proficiency_and_rhet1020, host_language_requirement, available_terms_json, fall_term_dates, spring_term_dates, final_semester_allowed, seat_quota, tuition_model, est_monthly_living_currency, est_monthly_living_min, est_monthly_living_max, living_cost_usd_est, living_cost_usd_est_status, mandatory_host_fees_and_insurance, housing_availability, housing_notes, host_grants_or_stipends, citizenship_restrictions, visa_lead_time_and_financial_proof, official_website_url, exchange_page_url, course_catalog_url, english_course_list_url, credit_system_and_load, course_restrictions_note, required_application_docs_json, academic_style, city_tier, campus_type, daily_life_english_friendliness, international_support_services, nomination_deadlines, ext_json, metadata_json) VALUES ('universita-degli-studi-di-torino', '[146]', 1, 'none', '[]', '[]', 'Università degli Studi di Torino', 'UniTo', 'Italy', NULL, 'Turin', 'Europe', 'active', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '["Italian","English"]', NULL, 'Formal English certificates are not strictly mandatory for admission, but UniTo strongly recommends CEFR B2 in English (or Italian depending on chosen courses). No RHET 1020 exemption stated.', 'CEFR B2 Italian recommended for Italian-taught courses (not strictly required for English courses); UniTo offers a free 5 ECTS Italian language course starting mid-October.', NULL, 'First Semester (AY 2026-2027): Lectures run roughly late Sep / mid-Oct (around 28 Sep 2026) through mid-Dec / Jan; exam window Jan-Feb 2027.', 'Second Semester (AY 2026-2027): Lectures run roughly mid-Feb (around 22 Feb 2027) through end of May / Jun; exam window Jun-Jul 2027; academic year ends 30 Sep 2027 (incl. Sep resit exams).', NULL, NULL, 'auc_exchange_waiver', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'unknown', 'Voluntary enrollment in the Italian National Health Service (SSN) costs EUR 700/calendar year (expiring Dec 31 regardless of activation date) per en.unito.it.', 'assisted', 'UniTo does not provide direct guaranteed university housing; students apply for regional EDISU Piemonte beds or rent privately in Turin with guidance at https://en.unito.it/living-turin.', NULL, NULL, 'Non-EU exchange students must obtain an Italian study entry visa prior to arrival via Universitaly / Visto per Italia portals (plus residence permit application ''permesso di soggiorno'' and Italian tax code ''codice fiscale'' on arrival).', 'https://en.unito.it/', 'https://en.unito.it/international-relations/students-mobility/exchange-students-and-erasmus-mobility', 'https://en.unito.it/international-relations/students-mobility/exchange-students-and-erasmus-mobility', NULL, 'CFU / ECTS credit system.', 'Students select courses mainly from their host department (cross-registration possible subject to nomination requirements and restricted-access capped programs ''corsi ad accesso programmato'').', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Winter Semester / Full Year: Nominations open mid-Feb to 15 June. Spring Semester: Nominations open mid-Feb to 15 November.', '{}', '{"academic_style":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"agreement_scope_raw":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"agreement_status":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:146","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"active"},"agreement_student_levels":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},