Lectures run roughly mid-Feb (around 22 Feb 2027) through end of May / Jun; exam window Jun-Jul 2027; academic year ends 30 Sep 2027 (incl. Sep resit exams)."},"state_or_province":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"tuition_model":{"notes":"Incoming exchange students under Erasmus+ or bilateral cooperation agreements do not pay tuition fees to UniTo (continue paying tuition to home university).","source_ref":"https://en.unito.it/international-relations/students-mobility/exchange-students-and-erasmus-mobility","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":"auc_exchange_waiver"},"visa_lead_time_and_financial_proof":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"https://en.unito.it/international-relations/students-mobility/exchange-students-and-erasmus-mobility","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":"Non-EU exchange students must obtain an Italian study entry visa prior to arrival via Universitaly / Visto per Italia portals (plus residence permit application ''permesso di soggiorno'' and Italian tax code ''codice fiscale'' on arrival)."}}');
