visa); UAntwerp issues an official invitation letter after Mobility-Online approval, and students must prove financial solvency (scholarship/grant, Annex 32, or UAntwerp blocked account). Residence permit required for stays >3 months (https://www.uantwerpen.be/en/study/international-mobility/erasmus-and-exchange-students/prepare-for-your-arrival/residence-permit/ and Factsheet p. 3). Exact lead time not stated."}}');
