ation typically late November–early December).', NULL, NULL, 'auc_exchange_waiver', 'EUR', 260, 718, 2702, 'partial', NULL, 'assisted', 'EUBA dormitories are allocated via AiS2 (~end of July for Winter) and paid monthly in advance (€65–450/month range across dorms vs private housing per living-costs guide).', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://www.euba.sk/en', 'https://euba.sk/en/international-relations/incoming-students', 'https://euba.sk/en/international-relations/incoming-students/courses-in-foreign-languages', 'https://euba.sk/en/international-relations/incoming-students/courses-in-foreign-languages', 'ECTS credit system; recommended load is ~30 ECTS/semester, with a minimum requirement of 3 courses selected from the List of Courses in Foreign Languages.', 'Incoming exchange students must choose at least 3 courses from the List of Courses in Foreign Languages.', '["Online application after home nomination","Learning Agreement / Online Learning Agreement (OLA)","Transcript of Records from home university","B2 English proficiency confirmation (e.g., from home coordinator)"]', 'Public economics and business university in Bratislava offering economics, finance, and management tracks plus a foreign-language exchange course portfolio.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Welcome Week orientation held before semester start.', 'Winter: nom May 1 / app May 15; Summer: nom Oct 15 / app Oct 31.', '{}', '{"academic_style":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"https://euba.sk/en/international-relations/incoming-students/courses-in-foreign-languages","source_type":"official_web","status":"partial","value":"Public economics and business university in Bratislava offering economics, finance, and management tracks plus a foreign-language exchange course portfolio."},"agreement_scope_raw":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:129","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"BADM + ECON"},"agreement_status":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_li