nd Sociology', '["HUSS"]', '["Psychology","Sociology"]', NULL, NULL, '["English","Dutch"]', 'substantial', 'Faculty of BSS requires CEFR B2 English for Bachelor courses and C1 for Master courses (Faculty of Arts requires B2/C1: IELTS 6.5 / TOEFL iBT 92, or C1/IELTS 7.0–8.0 / TOEFL 100–110 for selected MA tracks).', 'None for English-taught courses (CEFR B2/C1 Dutch required only for Dutch-taught courses).', '["Fall","Spring"]', 'Autumn Semester: September – January (expected arrival last week of August; see https://www.rug.nl/gmw/exchange/academic_calender/).', 'Spring Semester: February – June/July (expected arrival last week of January; CRITICAL: Sociology exchange courses in BSS are ONLY offered in Autumn semester!).', NULL, NULL, 'auc_exchange_waiver', 'EUR', 800, 1000, 4973.4, 'partial', 'Sufficient health insurance coverage is obligatory during the exchange (https://www.rug.nl/education/exchange/financial-matters/health-insurance-for-exchange-students); travel & third-party liability insurance strongly advised.', 'assisted', 'No campus-owned dorms; UG reserves short-stay rooms via SSH (https://www.sshxl.nl/en), plus At Home in Groningen; book as early as possible after admission.', NULL, NULL, 'University of Groningen Immigration Service Desk contacts admitted non-EU/EEA students with MVV/residence permit instructions (https://www.rug.nl/education/exchange/visa-and-immigration/); Dutch IND financial proof applies.', 'https://www.rug.nl/', 'http://www.rug.nl/gmw/exchange', 'https://www.rug.nl/gmw/exchange/course_information/course-offer', NULL, 'ECTS credit system (1 EC = 28 hours); normal workload 15 EC per block / 30 EC per semester.', 'BSS exchange students must major in Psychology, Sociology, or Pedagogical/Educational Sciences; Sociology & Pedagogical/Educational Sciences courses are offered ONLY in Autumn semester; no guarantee of taking courses at other faculties; Sem 1b resits are held in Groningen in April only (no remote exams).', NULL, 'Dutch/Europea