 2026-2027 Erasmus+ ICM.pdf#page=4","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"partial","value":"guaranteed"},"housing_notes":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/UoHelsinki/2026-2027/University of Helsinki Fact Sheet 2026-2027 Erasmus+ ICM.pdf#page=4","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"Applied during exchange registration via Unihome and HOAS apartments across Helsinki (rent typically EUR 450-800/month per https://studies.helsinki.fi/instructions/article/living-helsinki). UH covers EUR 260-500 room deposit (reclaimed post-exchange)."},"instruction_languages":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/UoHelsinki/2026-2027/University of Helsinki Fact Sheet 2026-2027 Erasmus+ ICM.pdf#page=4","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":["Finnish","Swedish","English"]},"international_support_services":{"notes":"Tutoring, ESN, and support services detailed on p.4-6.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/UoHelsinki/2026-2027/University of Helsinki Fact Sheet 2026-2027 Erasmus+ ICM.pdf#page=4","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"International Exchange Services on every campus (studentexchange@helsinki.fi), mandatory orientation week with student tutors, ESN Uni Helsinki, Unicafe, Unisport, Learning Centre Aleksandria, and disability/special arrangements services."},"living_cost_usd_est":{"notes":"Midpoint EUR 1,075.00/month (900-1,250 EUR/month) * 5 months = EUR 5,375.00; converted at ECB 2026-11-13 rate (collected 2026-11-15) 1 EUR = 1.1052 USD (https://www.ecb.europa.eu/stats/policy_and_exchange_rates/euro_reference_exchange_rates/html/index.en.html) = 5,940.45 USD.","source_ref":"https://studies.helsinki.fi/instructions/article/living-helsinki","source_type":"official_web","status":"partial","value":5940.45},"mandatory_host_fees_and_insurance":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/UoHelsinki/2026-2027/University of Helsinki Fact Sheet 2026-2027 Erasmus+ ICM.pdf#page=5","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"partial","value":"Tuition fees waived. Non-EU nationals must hold comprehensive health insurance prior to applying for a Migri residence permit (EUR 450 online permit fee, partially covered only for Erasmus+ ICM per agreement; UH purchases insurance only for Erasmus+ ICM). Student Union membership (EUR 40-45/sem) is voluntary for exchange students."},"min_gpa_host":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"min_standing_note":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/UoHelsinki/2026-2027/University of Helsinki Fact Sheet 2026-2027 Erasmus+ ICM.pdf#page=2","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"All applicants must have completed at least 1 year of university studies (2 years for Life Sciences and Psychology; 2 pre-clinical + 1 clinical year for Medicine)."},"nomination_deadlines":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/UoHelsinki/2026-2027/University of Helsinki Fact Sheet 2026-2027 Erasmus+ ICM.pdf#page=4","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"2026-27 strict periods: Autumn semester (Aug-Dec) nomination Mar 1 - Mar 31, student registration Apr 1 - Apr 15. Spring semester (Jan-May) nomination Aug 1 - Sep 15, student registration Sep 16 - Sep 30."},"official_name":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:151","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"University of Helsinki"},"official_website_url":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:151","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"https://www.helsinki.fi/en"},"region":{"notes":"From normalized manifest country/region mapping","source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:151","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"Europe"},"required_application_docs":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/UoHelsinki/2026-2027/University of Helsinki Fact Sheet 2026-2027 Erasmus+ ICM.pdf#page=4","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":["Home university online nomination","Online registration at University of Helsinki (no paper copies)","Learning Agreement (approved & signed by home coordinator)","Official Transcript of Records"]},"schema_version":"1.0.0","seat_quota":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"shard":5,"short_name":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:151","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"University of Helsinki"},"slug":"university-of-helsinki","spring_term_dates":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/UoHelsinki/2026-2027/University of Helsinki Fact Sheet 2026-2027 Erasmus+ ICM.pdf#page=4","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"Spring 2027: Jan 13 - May 31, 2027 (including mandatory orientation week)."},"state_or_province":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"tuition_model":{"notes":"Incoming exchange students under valid exchange agreements do not pay tuition fees to the University of Helsinki.","source_ref":"https://studies.helsinki.fi/instructions/article/how-apply-exchange-student","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":"auc_exchange_waiver"},"visa_lead_time_and_financial_proof":{"notes":"EUR 800/mo Migri threshold confirmed via helsinki.fi / migri.fi.","source_ref":"data/raw/factsheets/UoHelsinki/2026-2027/University of Helsinki Fact Sheet 2026-2027 Erasmus+ ICM.pdf#page=5","source_type":"fact_sheet","status":"verified","value":"Non-EU nationals must apply electronically via Finnish Immigration Service (Migri, http://migri.fi/en/studying-in-finland; EUR 450 fee) immediately upon receiving faculty acceptance (~4-6 wks post-deadline), visit Finnish consulate/authorized VFS in person, hold comprehensive health insurance, and show EUR 800/month financial proof."}}');
