0-Dec 22, 2026.', 'AY 2026-2027 Spring Semester: Jan 4-Jun 18, 2027 (orientation/instruction starts Mon Jan 11, 2027).', NULL, NULL, 'auc_exchange_waiver', 'NOK', 15250, 15250, 7973.08, 'partial', 'Tuition waived for exchange students; travel/health insurance strongly recommended by UiO (non-EU exchange students follow UDI study permit healthcare rules).', 'guaranteed', 'Guaranteed SiO student housing for international exchange students applying before the deadline; UiO monthly budget estimates NOK 7,500/month for housing.', NULL, NULL, 'Non-EU/EEA citizens require a Norwegian UDI Student Residence Permit and must document financial subsistence (transferred to SiO deposit account unless exempt): AY 2026-2027 NOK 170,368 full year, NOK 77,440 Autumn 2026 only, or NOK 92,928 Spring 2027 only. Lead time not specified.', 'https://www.uio.no/english/', 'https://www.uio.no/english/studies/admission/exchange/', 'https://www.uio.no/english/studies/courses/matnat/math/index.html', 'https://www.uio.no/english/studies/courses/matnat/math/index.html', 'ECTS credit system: normal full-time load is 30 ECTS per semester.', 'Agreement scoped to Actuarial Science Department / Department of Mathematics; 2000-level+ Mathematics and Insurance Mathematics courses (e.g. STK3505/4505/4540) require solid prerequisites in calculus, linear algebra, and probability.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Knutepunktet International Student Reception at Blindern campus, welcome orientation, and SiO student welfare/housing support.', 'Application deadlines: May 1 (Autumn semester); Oct 15 (Spring semester) [2020-2021 DOCX listed Nov 1 Spring].', '{}', '{"academic_style":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"agreement_scope_raw":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:141","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"Actuarial Science Department"},"agreement_status":{"notes":null,"source_ref":