redit system: normal full-time load is 30 ECTS per semester."},"cross_references":[],"daily_life_english_friendliness":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"eligible_auc_schools":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"eligible_majors":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"english_course_availability":{"notes":"Department of Mathematics offers multiple upper-level English-taught Actuarial/Insurance Mathematics courses (e.g., STK3505, STK4505, STK4520, STK4540, STK-MAT3700) open to exchange students meeting prerequisites.","source_ref":"https://www.uio.no/english/studies/courses/matnat/math/index.html","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":"substantial"},"english_course_list_url":{"notes":"Lists English-taught Mathematics/Statistics/Actuarial courses including STK3505 (https://www.uio.no/english/studies/courses/matnat/math/STK3505/).","source_ref":"https://www.uio.no/english/studies/courses/matnat/math/index.html","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":"https://www.uio.no/english/studies/courses/matnat/math/index.html"},"english_proficiency_and_rhet1020":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"https://www.uio.no/english/studies/admission/exchange/english-requirements.html","source_type":"official_web","status":"verified","value":"Non-native partner exchange students: Bachelor''s requires IELTS Academic 5.0 or TOEFL iBT 60 (or 3.5 on post-Jan 2026 0-6 scale); Master''s requires IELTS 6.5 (all sub-bands >=6.5) or TOEFL iBT 90 (or 4.5 on 0-6 scale). MyBest / One Skill Retake NOT accepted; specific partnership agreements may specify exemptions; RHET 1020 not mentioned."},"est_monthly_living_local":{"notes":"Official UiO student budget (Housing 7,500 + Food 3,500 + Transport 700 + Study 1,000 + Leisure 700 + Phone/net 400 + Health 250 + Other 1,200 = NOK 15,250/month).","source_ref":"https://www.