nd-aid/registrar/academic-calendars.', 'Spring semester begins in January and concludes in May; exact program calendars published at https://www.pacific.edu/admission-and-aid/registrar/academic-calendars.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'USD', 1777.6, 1777.6, 8888.0, 'partial', '2026-27 Student Health Insurance Plan (effective Jul 1, 2026 - Jun 30, 2027) is mandatory for international students at $1,984 per term/semester UG ($2,524/term Graduate & Pharmacy).', 'assisted', 'On-campus Stockton UG housing COA listed at $9,876/yr plus $7,900/yr food (meal plans typically bundled with residential housing).', NULL, NULL, 'J-1 exchange visitors require Form DS-2019 coordinated by International Programs after submitting a J-1 Personal Information Form, passport copy, official USD financial funding proof, and CV/statement.', 'http://www.pacific.edu/', NULL, 'https://www.pacific.edu/about-pacific/administrative-offices/office-of-the-registrar/academic-catalogs', 'https://www.pacific.edu/about-pacific/administrative-offices/office-of-the-registrar/academic-catalogs', 'US semester credit/unit system: full-time Stockton undergraduate flat-rate tuition load covers 12 to 18 units per semester (12-unit minimum full-time load for international visa compliance).', NULL, '["Home institution partner nomination","J-1 DS-2019 Personal Information Form","Passport biographical copy","Official proof of USD financial funding","Official academic transcripts / English test scores (if applicable)"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Pacific International Programs / International Admissions coordinates pre-arrival J-1 DS-2019 issuance, housing portal onboarding, and mandatory health insurance compliance.', NULL, '{}', '{"academic_style":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"agreement_scope_raw":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:148","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"University-wide"},"agre