through July (Q4 resits in July/August).', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'EUR', 1300.0, 1300.0, 7183.8, 'partial', NULL, 'assisted', 'Campus/city student rooms ~€350–550/month; 1 guaranteed offer provided for non-EEA exchange students via UT.', NULL, NULL, 'Non-EEA students need Dutch IND MVV entry visa / residence permit initiated by UT Student Services post-conditional admission. Strict Osiris visa milestones: Fall Jun 15 (questions), Jun 30 (fee/financial proof), Jul 15 (final upload); Spring Nov 15, Nov 30, Dec 15.', 'https://www.utwente.nl/', 'https://www.utwente.nl/en/education/exchange-students/', 'https://www.utwente.nl/en/education/course-catalogue/', NULL, 'ECTS (EC): standard full-time load 30 EC per semester (60 EC/year). Bachelor students take complete 15 EC quartile modules; Master students select individual 5 EC courses.', 'Exchange students must take >=60% of courses (Master) or >=1 module (Bachelor) from their assigned hosting faculty (BMS, EEMCS, ET, ITC, or TNW/S&T).', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Fall (Sep): Partner Nom Feb 1–Apr 1; Non-EEA App Apr 15 (Eng test May 25, LA Jun 5); EEA App May 15. Spring (Feb): Partner Nom Jul 1–Sep 1; Non-EEA App Sep 15 (Eng test Oct 25, LA Nov 5); EEA App Oct 15.', '{}', '{"academic_style":{"notes":null,"source_ref":null,"source_type":"unknown","status":"unknown","value":null},"agreement_scope_raw":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:150","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"Limited schools agree to the agreement"},"agreement_status":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:150","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":"active"},"agreement_student_levels":{"notes":null,"source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_extracted.json#Universities List!rows:150","source_type":"excel_list","status":"verified","value":["UG"]},"available_terms":{"notes":"Fall/Spring","source_ref":"data/raw/partner_list_ext